<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MALIKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALIKO</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="io">Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo andiche Maliko cho chitabu chimwe mu fitabu fitayi fyofili mu Lilagano lya sambi, Chitabu chino chinkweletsela ndongwa tsa Yesu Chilisito. Chila chitabu chinchemwa, “Injili.” Chinya kutijila, “Ndongwa Nofu.” Fyandikwe hala hoavaga kufwa Yesu. Wo vandiche fitabu ifyo fimwinga wo iva, Matayo na Luka na Yohana. Ndongwa Nofu kota fyoandiche Maliko cho chitabu chidodo kulutila fila fiyage. Hihila vasomi va ndongwa tsa Bibiliya vanlonga kuta chino cho chitabu chilongola kwandikwa kwa fiyage ifyo fidatu. Chitabu chino chandikwe myaka ja sitini na jihanu mbaka sabini kuhuma Yesu aleleche. Kaha vanlonga kuta chitabu chino chandikwe ku inyi ya Loma na Maliko andiche ili kuvakangatsa numbula vanu yo vamutumbilaga Chilisito yo vikalaga ku inyi iyo ya Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hihila Maliko yuno vanu vamutselaga kwa litawa lya Yohana Maliko na hamutalo baho vajendasaga na Pawulo na Balinaba. Yavaga munyi gumwe akalemaje kujendasa na vayage mu lujendo lwa kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu. Ng'olwa 13:13. Hambele Maliko vakalekanaje na Pawulo na akabitasaje na Balinaba. Pawulo akamutegulaje Sila ili vajendase Ng'olwa 15:37-39 Maliko ali munu va habehi ndalahela na mutumi Petulo. Petulo 1:5-13. Nayivaje Maliko siatsiwene ndongwa tso adisile Yesu, vasomi vanlonga kuta Maliko avisile ntsiwuko ntsolofu tsa mutumi Petulo. Ugo go musinji gwa kwandika chitabu chino cha Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo andiche Maliko. Mu Ndongwa tsino Nofu tsoandiche Maliko tsingutudahitsa hila fyo tufuluche tuvadite vanu vave vadahitswa va Yesu na madahitso ga Yesu ga siku tsa wudugo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mugati mwa chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="io">Maliko angucheletsela chitabu. Maliko 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Maliko anlonga Ndongwa tsa Yesu hoavaga ku Galilaya Maliko 1:14-8:12</para>
  <para style="io">Maliko ankweletsela lujendo lwa Yesu lwa kubita ku Yelusalemu Maliko 8:22-10:52</para>
  <para style="io">Maliko ansinda kwa kwandika Ndongwa tsa kuwudugo tsoadisile Yesu ku Yelusalemu na hila Yesu fyo akodiche na kufwa. Kaha anlonga hila Yesu fyo atsilipuche Maliko 11:1-16:8</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mubatitsi anvikula kutsa kwa Yesu Chilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lukasi 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Uguno go mwantso gwa Ndongwa Nofu tsa Yesu Chilisito, Mwana va Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ndongwa itso tsikantsitse kota fyoandiche Isaya Muloli va Mulungu. “Mulungu alontsile hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">Ntsingumutuma jumbe vangu halutalo hako yo akugolola ndongwa tsako.”<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />“Munu anchema kuhuma ku mbuga kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Mumuwuyapile Mutwa ng'asi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">na mwiviche chang'ani kumwanuchila Mutwa ho akuva akutsa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Jumbe uyo avaga Yohana Mubatitsi yo ahumye ku mbuga na kuvavikulila vanu kuta, van'ganika valeche ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na kumupituchila Mulungu na kubatitswa, na Mulungu akuvahulumila. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Vanu luhuma chila hono ha inyi ya Yudea, na vala wo vikalaga ku muji gwa Yelusalemu vabitaga kumuhulikitsa Yohana. Vakamusukaje Mulungu avahulumile ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na kutsileka, na vabatitswaga na Yohana mu lulenga lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana avaga afwite mugolole go guhonilwe kwa mibahila ja linyama lyo linchemwa ngamiya, kaha avaga afwite luleheje lwa nyingo mu chigudi. Chilyo chake chavaga wuchi wa kumuhulo na mipantsi jo jinchemwa ntsije. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Nayo Yohana akavavikulilaje vanu kuta, “Halutalo hangu akutsa munu muvina kulutila heni, ho ihyo heni sifuluche mbopole ndejesi tsa ndatu mu magulu gake. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Heni tsinguvabatitsa kwa malenga, lechelelo mwene uyo akuvabatitsa kwa Muhe va Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu am'batitswa na kujelwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matayo 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lukasi 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Chipindi chicho Yesu akatsaje kuhuma ku muji gwa Natsaleti go gwavaga ku Galilaya akafikaje kwa Yohana, nayo Yohana akamubatitsaje mu lulenga lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Luvala lulo Yesu ho avaga kuhuma mu malenga, akawonaje kilanga kwa Mulungu kudinduche na Muhe va Mulungu akamwichilaje kota hila ng'unda. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Litsi lya Mulungu kuhuma kilanga likahulikwaje linlonga, “Heve yo Mwanangu yo nguganile, yo nganitswe na heve.” <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Luvala lulo Muhe va Mulungu akamulongotsaje Yesu kubita ku mbuga, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Yesu akavaje uko ku mbuga siku alubayini kuno an'jelwa na Lihoka. Kuko ikalaga hamwe na minyama ja mwijejele, nawo vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu vavaga vangumutanga.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvachema valova somba vatayi vamufwate</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lukasi 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku nstolofu Yohana akawopwaje mu nyumba ya vawopwa. Yohana hoavaga kuwopwa, Yesu akabitaje ku muji gwa Galilaya kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />akavalonjelaje, “Chipindi cho alialontsile Mulungu chifisile, na Chipindi cha Mulungu kutavala. Mun'ganika mupituche na kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi, na kutsitumbila Ndongwa Nofu!” <verse eid="MRK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Siku yimwe Yesu ho avaga an'jenda mulubali lwa lilamba lya Galilaya, akavawonaje valova somba vavili, Simoni hamwe na mung'olotse yo achemwaga Andeleya, vanlova somba kwa nyafu tsawo. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mutse mufwate, na heni nguvadita muvalete vanu kwa heni kota hila fyo mwalovaga somba.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Luvala lulo Petulo na Andeleya vakatsilekaje nyafu tsawo na kumufwata Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu ho avaga kubita halutalo chidogo, akavawonaje vana vavili va Tsebedayo, yo vachemwaga Yakobo na muyage Yohana. Nawo vavaga mugati mwa mutumbwi gwawo van'wuyapa nyafu tsawo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Luvala lulo akavachemaje, nawo vakamulekaje Tsebedayo dadawo hamwe na vakola katsi mu mutumbwi na vakamufwataje Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu munya lisoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Lukasi 4:31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Hambele Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakafikaje ku muji gwa Kapelenahumu, na ho yavaga kufika Siku ya Weselo wa Vayawudi, Yesu akinjilaje mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi na akantsaje kudahitsa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Vanu veka vakapomokaje kwasawuli ya gala madahitso gadahitsaga Yesu, kwasawuli mwene siadahitsaga kota vadahitsi vawo va malajitso ga Musa, lechelelo adahitsaga kwa wuvetso wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Luvala lulo ho avaga an'dahitsa, munu yumwe munya lisoka akakolaje, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />akalongaje, “Una chichi na hetwe heve Yesu va ku Natsaleti? Mbe, utsitse kutwananga? Tukutsele kuta heve yo mubagulwa va wiyeka kuhuma kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Lechelelo Yesu akaling'anulilaje lila lisoka kwa kulilonjela kuta, “Katuche! Uhume mugati mwa munu yuno!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Lila lisoka likamutigasaje fikami na likakolaje na kumuhuma. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Vanu veka yo vavaga mu nyumba yila vakatinukaje na kwiwutsa kuta, “Tsino tso ndongwa tsachi? Mbe, iga go madahitso ga sambi? Munu yuno angujing'anulila misoka najo jingumuhulikitsa!” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Luvala lulo ndongwa tso adisile Yesu tsikatagalilaje ku muji gweka gwa Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vanu wolofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lukasi 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Luvala lulo hovavaga kuhuma mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake yo vachemwaga Simoni, na Andeleya, na Yakobo, na Yohana vakabitaje ku kaye kwa Simoni na Andeleya. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Yesu ho avaga kufika vakamulonjelaje, “Yuve va mudala va Simoni ana filungo ndalahela na avasise mu chinanda.” <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu akabitaje iho hoali avasise yuve va mudala va Simoni, na kumubata liwoko na kumwinula. Luvala lulo akaponaje na kwantsa kuvatelechela chilyo. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Hoyavaga kufika mumihe na Siku ya Weselo yavaga kuduga, vanu vakamusindichilaje Yesu vatamwa wolofu na vanu wo vana misoka. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Vanu wolofu yo vikalaga muji gula vakakong'asikaje hivala ha lwitsi lwa nyumba yoavaga Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Nayo Yesu akavaponetsaje vanu wolofu na vanya matamwa ganjiganji. Kaha akajivingaje misoka myolofu, lechelelo kwasawuli jene jatselaga kuta Yesu yo nani, misoka jila sijalontsile chinu chochive.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvavikulila Ndongwa Nofu vanu va ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Lukasi 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Hamilawu iyage, Yesu akilavaje kung'acha kutitu, akabitaje hono ha wiyeka kumusuka Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Hambele Simoni hamwe na vayage vakabitaje kumusaka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Hovavaga kumuwona vakamulonjelaje, “Chila munu angukusaka heve.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Tubite hono hanji ku miji ja habehi, kuko nako ngavikule Ndongwa Nofu, kwasawuli ntsitsitse kwa lulongwa lulo.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ihyo Yesu akabitaje chila hono ku Galilaya kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu, avikwe mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi na kujivinga misoka.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu munya wububa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lukasi 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Munu yumwe yo akodekaga na wutamwa wa wububa akabitaje kwa Yesu, akamufugamilaje na kumusuka, “Manyi ugane ufuluche umonetse ili tsidichilwe mu ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu!” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu akamuwonelaje lusungu munu yula, na akagololaje liwoko lyake akamudometsaje na kumulonjela, “Ntsin'gana upone ili udichilwe mu ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Luvala lulo munu yula akaponaje wutamwa wa wububa wo avaganawo na kidichilwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Kahi Yesu akamulonjelaje munu yula awuche, na akamufundaje kuta, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Lekaje kumulonjela munu yoyuve lulongwa ulu longuditye, lechelelo un'ganika ubite ukilajile kwa muvina va vatawula nambiko, na ukatawule nambiko kwasawuli ya kukwemwa uko kota fyo alialajitse Musa, ili vakulave fyo uponile wutamwa wa wububa.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Lechelelo munu yula akawukaje na kwantsa kuvikula ndongwa tsila tsa kukwemwa kwake. Ihyo Yesu injilaga mu muji kwa lufiho na kwikala hono ho hagaya vanu, lechelelo vanu kuhuma chila hono vakatsaje ho ali.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu yo apotsile muvili gweka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lukasi 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku tsitunga, Yesu akawuyaje ku muji gwa Kapelinawumu, na vanu vakatselaje kuta ali hakaye hoikalaga. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Luvala lulo vanu wolofu vakakong'anaje mu nyumba yila yoali Yesu mbaka kukavaje kuduhu nyafwasi yoyive, kwasawuli vanu vavaga vamemile mbaka ha lwitsi. Na Yesu akavavikulilaje ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Vakatsaje vanu vatayi yovali vamupisile munu mu lusaga, yoali apotsile muvili gweka vakamuletaje kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Vakalemwaje kumulutitsa halwitsi, kwasawuli ya vanu yovali vamemile mu nyumba yila. Ihyo vakakwinaje kuchanya na kuhima hono hala ho ali Yesu, vakakutubulaje na kumwisa mu lusaga. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu avaga kuwona fyo vangumutumbila, akamulonjelaje mutamwa yula yoapotsile muvili, “Mwanangu nguhulumye ndongwa tsako tseka ntsibi.” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Lechelelo vadahitsi vatunga va malajitso ga Musa yovavaga vichite hono iho vakahotsaje mu numbula tsawo kuta, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Chinu chachi choanlonga munu yuno? Hino angumuliga Mulungu! Kwasawuli kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche kumuhulumila munu ndongwa tsibi, lechelelo Mulungu ng'ani.” <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Luvala lulo Yesu akatselaje cho vahotsaga, nayo akavalonjelaje, “Mbe, ndawuli munhotsa ihyo mu numbula tsenyu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Mbe, chichi cho chipefu? Kumulonjela munu yo apotsile muvili gweka kuta, nguhulumye ndongwa tsako ntsibi, awu kulonga, winuche utole lusaga lwako ubite? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Lechelelo ntsin'gana mutsele kuta, heni Mwana va Munu fuluche ntsimuhulumile munu ndongwa tsake tsibi mu inyi.” Kaha Yesu akamulonjelaje yula munu yo avaga apotsile muvili, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Ntsingukulonjela, wime utegule lusaga lwako ubite kukaye kwako!” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Luvala lulo yula munu yo apotsile muvili akimaje kuno vanu veka vangumulava, akitwikaje lusaga lwake na kuwuka mu nyumba yila. Vanu veka vakapomokaje na kumutsumitsa Mulungu, vakalongaje, “Kuhuma iho sitwali tuluwene lulongwa kota luno!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuchema Lavi amufwate</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lukasi 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu akabitaje kahi mu lubali lwa lilamba lya Galilaya. Vanu wolofu vakabitaje kuko, nayo akantsaje kuvadahitsa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Hoavaga an'jenda mulubali mwa lilamba lila, akamuwonaje mukongotsa kodi yo achemwaga Lavi mwana va Alifayo ichite hono ha kukongotsela kodi. Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Ufwate heni!” Lavi akimaje na kumufwata Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Hambele Lavi akamulibulitsaje Yesu na vadahitswa vake kukaye yake alye chilyo cha mumihe. Vakongotsa kodi wolofu, na vanu yo vatselanikaga kuta vanya ndongwa ntsibi vavaga vichite mu metsa hamwe na Yesu na vadahitswa vake kuno vankulya. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Lechelelo vadahitsi vatunga va malajitso ga Musa yo vachemwaga Mafwalisayo hovavaga kumuwona Yesu ankulya hamwe na vakongotsa kodi na vanya ndongwa ntsibi, vakavaputsaje vadahitswa vake kuta, “Kwasawuli yachi Yesu ankulya hamwe na vanu vano?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso akavalonjelaje, “Vanu wo sinambe vatamiche sivabitaga kwa muganga, wo vabitaga kwa muganga vavaga vatamwa. Heni sintsitsitse kuvachema vanu vawuya ili vatse kwa Mulungu, lechelelo ntitsitse kuvachema wo vanya ndongwa ntsibi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankwiganitsa madahitso gake na ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lukasi 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Chipindi chimwe vadahitswa va Yohana na vadahitswa va Mafwalisayo velekaga kulya kwasawuli ya kumusuka Mulungu. Vanu vatunga vakatsaje kumuputsa Yesu, “Kwasawuli yachi vadahitswa va Yohana na va Mafwalisayo valekagaga kulya kwasawuli ya Mulungu, lechelelo vadahitswa vako sinambe valeche kulya kwasawuli ya kumusuka Mulungu?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mbe, vajentsi yo vachemilwe ku litsenjele vafuluche valeche kulya manyi vave hamwe na munya kukwela? Chipindi cheka chovakuva hamwe na munya kukwela sivafuluche valeche kulya!” <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Lechelelo chikufika chipindi munya kukwela ho akuva alihaduhu, iho ho vakuganika valeche kulya. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Kuduhu munu yo afuluche ahoneletse chilaka chipya mu mwenda mulovela. Lechelelo manyi adite ihyo, chila chilaka chipya chikumamuka kuhuma mu mwenda gula mulovela, na hala ho hatubwiche hakuva hakomi. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kaha kuduhu munu yo avikaga difwayi ntsipya mu mifuko misakafu ja nyingo ya ng'olo. Manyi adite ihyo mifuko jila misakafu jikutwadika na difwayi yila yikubohoka. Ihyo difwayi ntsipya yivikwaga mumifuko mipya.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yo Mutwa va Siku ya Weselo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lukasi 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Siku ya Weselo wa Vayawudi, Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vavaga vankola hagatinagati ha migunda. Hovavaga van'jenda, vadahitswa vake vakantsaje kupulula maho kota ga wuhemba na kulya. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafwalisayo vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Kwasawuli yachi vadahitswa vako vampulula maho kota ga wuhemba Siku ya Weselo?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mbe, simulasoma mu Mandiko Mahagulwa chila choadisile Dawudi hamwe na vayage hala ho vavaga na ntsala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Hila fyo inje mugati mwa Nyumba ya Mulungu hala Abiatsali ho avaga muvina va vatawula nambiko, akalyaje na kuvapela vayage mabumunda gala ga wulajilo? Mabumunda go sigaganikaga galiwe na munu yoyuve ila na vatawula nambiko ng'ani?” <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Kaha Yesu akavalonjelaje Mafwalisayo, “Siku ya Weselo yadisilwe kwasawuli ya kuvamutanga vanu, na siyo vanu kuva vapogotsi va Siku ya Weselo. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kaha heni Mwana va Munu yo Mutwa va Siku ya Weselo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu Siku ya Weselo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lukasi 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Siku yinji ya Weselo Yesu akinjilaje kaha mu Nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, na mumo mwavaga na munu munya liwoko lyo lipotsile. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Mafwalisayo vamwinga vavaga hono vansaka chambutso cha kumuhijila Yesu, ihyo vamuhimaga Yesu valole manyi akumuponetsa munu uyo mu Siku ya Weselo. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu akamulonjelaje munu yula munya liwoko lyo lipotsile kuta, “Utse iha hagati ha vanu veka.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Yesu akavaputsaje vanu vala, “Mbe, Chinu chachi chinofu chochin'ganika kuditwa Siku ya Weselo, kudita ndongwa nofu awu ntsibi? Mbe, tun'ganika kukulusa vanu awu kuvakopola?” Lechelelo vanu vala vakakatukaje myee! <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu akavalavaje vanu chila lubali kwa lilakali, akavang'ung'utilaje kwasawuli vavaga valihela litumbilo. Kahi akamulonjelaje yula munya liwoko lipotsile, “Golole liwoko lyako.” Yula munu akagololaje, nalyo liwoko likavaje lyumi nachene! <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ihyo Mafwalisayo vakahumaje kivala kwa Nyumba yila ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, vakakong'anaje hamwe na vatantsi va Helode na vakalonganaje hila fyo vafuluche vamukopole Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu wolofu vangumufwata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakabitaje mbaka mu lubali lwa lilamba lya Galilaya, na vanu wolofu kuhuma ku Galilaya na ku Yudeya hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa tseka tso avaga an'dita Yesu vakamufwataje. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Vanu vanji wolofu vakatsaje kuhuma ku Yudeya, na ku Yelusalemu, na ku Idumaya, na kumwambu gwa lulenga lwa Yolidani, na vanji vahumye kubehi na muji gwa Tilo na muji gwa Sidoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake vamuvichile chang'ani mutumbwi mudodo ili injile vanu valeche kumutifya kwasawuli ya vanu vavaga wolofu. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Vanu vala vamutifyaga Yesu kwasawuli avaga avaponitse vatamwa wolofu, na ihyo vatamwa vanji vikunugintsaga ili vamudometse. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Vanu yo vavaga na misoka ho vavaga kumuwona Yesu vitotsaga hasi halutalo hake, na kukola na kulonga, “Heve uli mwana va Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Lechelelo Yesu akajilemetsaje jila misoka jileche kihala kuta mwene yo nani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahagula vatumi kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lukasi 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Hambele Yesu akakwinaje ku chidunda, na akavachemaje vala yo anguvagana mwene, nawo vakabitaje kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Akavahagulaje vanu kumi na vavili yo avachemile vatume. Kahi akavalonjelaje, “Ntsivahagwe henye muve hamwe na heni, ili ntsivatume kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Akavapelaje wuvetso wa kujivinga misoka.” <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Iva wo vanu kumi na vavili yo avahagwe Simoni, yo Yesu amupelye litawa lya Petulo, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />na Yakobo na Yohana yo vavaga vana va Tsebedayo, iwo yo Yesu avachemile litawa lya Boanelije, linya mana ya, “Vana va Chibumo,” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />na Andeleya, na Filipo, na Batolomayo, na Matayo, na Tomasi, na Yakobo mwana va Alufwayo, na Tadeyi, na Simoni yo avaga mutova ligalu va inyi yake, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda va ku Isikaliyoti yula yo hambele amugaluche Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yo muvina kulutila Balitsebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lukasi 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Kaha Yesu ho avaga kwinjila mu nyumba, vanu wolofu vakakong'anaje kaha, mbaka Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakalemwaje kulya kwasawuli avatangaga vanu. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Vang'olotse Yesu hovavaga kuhulika ihyo vakatsaje kumutegula, kwasawuli valongaga kuta, “Apasile chijeni.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Vadahitsi vamwinga va malajitso ga Musa yo vatsitse kuhuma ku Yelusalemu vakalongaje, “Yesu anlongotswa na Beelitsebuli livina lya misoka, na angujivinga misoka kwa wuvetso wa ilyo livina lya misoka.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Duve Yesu akavaputsaje kwa muhwano guno, “Mbe, Lihoka lifuluche ndawuli lihetse lyene? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Manyi wuntsajila wumwe wigavite, wuntsajila uwo siwufuluche wime. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Kaha manyi kuve na vanu va kaye yimwe vigavite, kaye iyo yikwananjika. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ihyo manyi wuntsajila wa Lihoka wigavite wukwima chinya ndawuli? Wukwananjika na wukuduga. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Kuduhu munu yo afuluche injile mu kaye ya munu munya ludalu na kutegula finu fyake bila kulongola kumuwopa. Mbaka ho akumuwopa ho akuvetsa kumusukula finu fyake. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Ntsinguvalonjela nachene, Mulungu afuluche amuhulumile munu ndongwa ntsibi tsotsive tso akudita, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />lechelelo munu yo angumuliga Muhe va Mulungu, uyo siafuluche ahulumilwe. Kwasawuli akuva adisile wubi wa siku tseka.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu alontsile ndongwa itso kwasawuli vali vamulonje kuta, “Mwene anlongotswa na Balitsebuli livina lya misoka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vang'olotse va Yesu va wukweli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lukasi 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Vakatsaje yuve na vang'olotse va Yesu. Vakimaje kivala na kumutuma munu akavachemele Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Nawo vanu wolofu vavaga vichite kwa kumpilima vangumuhulikitsa Yesu, nawo vanu vala vakamulonjelaje, “Yuwo na vang'olotso na vahatsawo vali kivala vangukusaka!” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Yuvangu na vang'olontsangu yo vanani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Yesu kapugasaje na kuvalola vanu yo vichite chila lubali na kulonga, “Mulave! Iva yo vayuvangu na vang'olotsangu va wukweli. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Munu yoyuve yo an'dita ndongwa tso an'gana Mulungu, uyo yo mung'olotsangu, na yo muhatsavangu, na yo yuvangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa mumitsi va nyadikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lukasi 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu akantsaje kaha kudahitsa vanu mulubali lwa lilamba lya Galilaya. Vanu wolofu vakamukong'asichilaje, akinjilaje kwikala mu mutumbwi ili vanu valeche kumutifya. Vanu veka vakikalaje mulubali lwa lila lilamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Avadahitsaga ndongwa ntsolofu kwa mihwano, na mu madahitso gake akavalonjelaje, <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Munyulikitse! Mumitsi avaga ahele kumitsa nyadikwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Iho ho amitsaga, nyadikwa tsinji tsikagwaje mulubali lwa ng'asi, fikatsaje fideje fikatsidobolangaje. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Nyadikwa ntsinji tsikagwaje hono ho havaga na lilongo lidodo ho havaga na litalawe, simusika tsikotaje na kwasawuli ya lilongo lila lidodo. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Lechelelo litsuva ho lyaveye kuvala, filyo fila fikakalaje kwasawuli ya ndela tsake kuva muchanyamuchanya hela. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ntsinji tsakagwaje mu misati ja mifwa, na jila mifwa jikakalagalaje na kutsipilinga fila filyo na fikalemwaje kulela meche yoyive. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Lechelelo nyadikwa tsinji tsikagwaje mu lilongo linofu, ntsikotaje na kukalagala na kulela, yimwe yalelite meche salasini, na yimwe meche sitini, na yinji yikalelaje meche miya moja.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Kahi Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Munu munya mapilichilo na ahuliche!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chambutso cha Yesu kudahitsa kwa mihwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lukasi 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Lechelelo hambele Yesu ho avaga aliyena, vanu vamwiga wo vavaga vamupilime hamwe na vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili, vakatsaje kumuwutsa avalonjele mana tsa jila mihwano. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Nayo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mulungu avagavye henye nyala tsa kutsela fiho tsa Wuntsajila wake. Lechelelo yo valikivala vanlonjelwa chila chinu kwa mihwano,<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ili manyi valave,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">valeche kudaha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Kaha vahuliche cho ntsilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">valeche kutsela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Ili valeche kupituka na kuleka ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na Mulungu avahulumile.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvadadambulila muhwano gwa mumitsi va nyadikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lukasi 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Kahi Yesu akavaputsaje, “Manyi sinambe mugutsele muhwano guno, mufuluche ndawuli kugutsela muhwano goguve? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mumitsi yo muvikutsi va ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Nyadikwa tso tsigweye halubali lwa ng'asi, tsihwana na vanu vala yo vahuliche ndongwa tsa Mulungu, lechelelo simusika Lihoka likatsitse na kutegula madahitso gala go gamitsitswe mugati mwawo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Nyadikwa tso tsamitsitswe mulitalawe ho hanya lilongo lidodo, tsihwana na vanu vala wovanhulika ndongwa tsa Mulungu, na luvala ulo ho vanhulika vavaga na wusangalo. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Lechelelo vitumbilaga kwa chipindi chidodo hela, manyi tsivapate ng'odeko vagotsolaga na kuleka kutsitumbila ndongwa tsa Mulungu, kwasawuli vanakota ndela tso tsili muchanya muchanya hela. Ihyo ndongwa tsa Mulungu sitsingikala mu numbula tsawo. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Nyadikwa tso tsamitsitswe mu misati ja mifwa, tsingihwana na vanu vala yo vahuliche ndongwa tsa Mulungu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />lechelelo muhwehwe gwa kuhotsa finu fya muinyi, na mbwiniwo tsa mali, na mbwiniwo tsinjitsinji, tsitifitsaga ndongwa tsa Mulungu tso vanuchye vanu vala valeche kudita kota ndongwa tsa Mulungu fyo tsin'gana. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Nyadikwa tso tsimitsitswe mu lilongo linofu, tsingihwana na vanu vala yo vahuliche ndongwa tsa Mulungu, na kutsanuchila na kudita kota ndongwa tsa Mulungu fyo tsin'gana, kota hila meche fyo tsilelaga salasini, na tsimwe sitini, na tsinji miya moja.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa lusolola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Lukasi 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu akendelelaje kuvalonjela, “Mbe, vanu vasaga lusolola na kwinjila nalo mu nyumba na kulugubikitsa mu chiya awu kulufiha mwifungu? Vanu sivaditaga ihyo, lechelelo vavikaga hachanya ha lukantsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Hohihyo chinu chochive cho chifihilwe chikuwoneka, na chinu chochive cho chigubikwe chikugubulwa na kuva helu. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Munu munya mapulichilo na ahuliche!” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu akawilaje kulonga, “Muhulikitse finofu chino cho munhulika. Hila fyo ungitawula kuhulikitsa ndongwa tsa Mulungu, hihyo Mulungu akumutanga na kumudita alitsele hilo. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Munu yula yo anhulikitsa ndongwa tsa Mulungu na kutsitsela, Mulungu akumutanga na kumudita alitsele hilo. Manyi munu sinambe ahulikitse ndongwa tsa Mulungu, hata tsila ndongwa ndodo tsa Mulungu tso atsitsele akusukulwa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa nyadikwa yo yinkota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu akendelelaje kulonga, “Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwana hino. Munu yumwe amitsitse nyadikwa kumugunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Hachilo avasaga na mumunyi avaga miho, na kuno nyadikwa tsila tsinkota na kwendelela kukalagala bila mwene kutsela lulongwa ulo fyoluli. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Yavaga hihyo kwasawuli lilongo lyene lyotetsaga na kukalagatsa filyo. Fyantsaga na lihamba na hambele fyalulaga maho na hawudugo fivikaga meche. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Hambele fikangalaga, na simusika ategulaga sentsa na kuhenga kwasawuli chipindi cha kubeta chifisile.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwano gwa nyadikwa ya muhaladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayo 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lukasi 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Mbe, tsiwuhwananitse na chinu chachi Wuntsajila wa Mulungu? Tufuluche tuwulonje chinya ndawuli?” <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Wuntsajila wa Mulungu wihwana na nyadikwa ya mubichi gwa muhaladali, nyadikwa iyo yo ndodo kulutila nyadikwa tseka tsa mu inyi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Lechelelo manyi yiyalwe, yikalagalaga na kuva libichi likomi kulutila mibichi jeka ja muchinyungu. Mitambi jake jikalagalaga na kuva mikomi mbaka fideje fikatavaje fifulila mu mitambi jake. <verse eid="MRK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu akavavikulilaje vanu ndongwa tsake kwa mihwano myolofu kota jino, alongaga nawo chinya ihyo kota hila fyo velewaga ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesu si alongaga nawo lulongwa loluve bila mihwano, lechelelo ho avaga hamwe na vadahitswa vake avadadambulilaga chila chinu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguyikatukitsa ng'ala ngomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lukasi 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Siku yiyila ho yavaga kuva mumihe, Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Tulowoche kumwambu gwa lilamba.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Duve vakavalekaje vanu vala wolofu, na kubita ku mutumbwi goavaga Yesu, vakawukaje hamwe nayo. Hihila na vanu vanji vavaga hamwe mu mitumbwi jinji mulujendo lula. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Hambele yikawugaje ng'ala ngomi na kugakunugitsa mavimbi. Nago gala mavimbi gakagutovaje mutumbwi gula goavaga akwinile Yesu, na mutumbwi gukantsaje kumema malenga. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu avaga avasise kumbele mu tumbwi na kuno asegamitse mutwi gwake mu muhagu. Vadahitswa vake vakamulamusaje na kumulonjela, “Mudahitsi mbe, sinambe ulave kuta hetwe tun'yaga mu malenga?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu akalamukaje akaying'anulilaje ng'ala yila ngomi kwa kugalonjela mavimbi gala, “Katuche, mye!” Bahobaho ng'ala yila yikalekaje, kukasichimalaje. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Kahi Yesu akavaputsaje vadahitswa vake, “Munkogopa chichi? Mbe, mung'acha mulihela litumbilo?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Vadahitswa va Yesu vakavaje na muloto ndalahela na vakiputsaje, “Mbe, yuno munu vachi, mbaka ng'ala ngomi na mavimbi fingumuhulikitsa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu munya misoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lukasi 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na vadahitswa vake vakalowokaje kumwambu gwa lilamba lya Galilaya, vakafikaje ku inyi ya Vajelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Iho Yesu ho avaga kwika mu mutumbwi, luvala lulo akitang'anaje na munu yumwe munya lisoka anhuma ku makabuli. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Munu uyo ikalaga ku makabuli, na sikwavaga na munu yo avetsaga kumuwopa na yivaje kwa nyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Mala tsongofu vanu vamuwopaga magulu na mawoko munu uyo kwa nyololo na pingu. Lechelelo mwene abenangaga pingu itso na kudumulanga nyololo tsila, na kwasawuli iyo kwavaga kuduhu munu yoyuve munya ludali lwa kumwibata. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Hamunyi na hachilo ikalaga ku makabuli na ku fidunda, kuno ankola na kitemanga kwa maganga. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Hoavaga kumuwona Yesu ang'acha kutali, akamubilimilaje na kumufugamila, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />na akakolaje, “Heve Yesu mwana va Mulungu va kilanga ndalahela, choun'gana chinu chachi kwa heni? Kwa litawa lya Mulungu ntsingukusuka uleche kung'oda.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Lisoka ilyo lyalontsile ihyo kwasawuli Yesu avaga aling'anulye lisoka lila kwa kulilonjela, “Hume kwa munu yuno!” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Kaha Yesu akaliwutsaje lisoka lila, “Litawa lyako uli nani?” Nalyo likalongaje, “Litawa lyangu Lijesi, kwasawuli hetwe tuli wolofu!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Misoka jila jikamugongolaje Yesu, aleche kujivinga kivala na inyi yila. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Habehi na hono iho havaga na chipinga chikomi cha migubi cho chadimwaga mulubali lwa chidunda. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ihyo misoka ijo jeka jikamugongoletsaje Yesu, “Utuleche tukinjile mumigubi jila.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Nayo Yesu akajidikitsaje cho jimulonje. Jila misoka jikamuhumaje na kwinjila mu migubi jila. Chipinga cheka chikikaje luvilo hohamwe ku lweta na kwinjila mu lilamba, jikagabilaje na kufwa, migubi ijo javaga kota elufu tsivili. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Vanu yo vajituntsaga migubi jila vakabilimaje, na vakavavikulilaje vanu ndongwa itso ku muji na ku fijiji. Vanu vakatsaje kulava chochihumye. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Vanu vala hovavaga kufika kwa Yesu, vakamuwonaje munu yula yo ahumitswe misoka aponile, afwite myenda na kikalisa hasi, vanu vala vakavaje na muloto ndalahela. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Vanu veka yo valuwene lulongwa ulo vakavalonjelaje vayawo chila chochamupasile munu yula yoavaga na misoka na chila cho chijipasile migubi jila. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Nawo vakamugongolaje Yesu awuche mu inyi yawo. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Hala Yesu hoavaga ankwina mu mutumbwi, munu yula yoavaga na misoka iho hamutalo akamusukaje Yesu vabitase. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Lechelelo Yesu akamulemetsaje na kumulonjela, “Ubite kukaye kwa vang'olotso, ukavalonjele ndongwa tso akuditye Mutwa Mulungu na hila fyo akuwon'ye lusungu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ihyo munu yula akawukaje na kwantsa kuvavikulila vanu va hono ho hanchemwa Dekapoli, chinya kutijila miji kumi ndongwa tseka tsila tso amuditye Yesu, na vanu veka vakavaje kuhulika, vakapomokaje.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumutsipula mwanahintsa va Yayilo na angumuponetsa mudala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lukasi 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu akalowokaje kaha kumwambu gwa lilamba kwa mutumbwi. Akimaje halubali lwa lilamba, na vanu wolofu vakatsaje hono hoali. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Akatsaje munu yumwe chilongotsi va hono ha kwitang'anila Vayawudi yo achemwaga Yayilo, akavaje kumuwona Yesu akamufugamilaje, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />na kumugongola kwa kumulonjela, “Muhintsa vangu antamika ndalahela na alibehi kutajika. Dedede ntsingukugongola tubite ukamusuchile kwa kumuvichila mawoko gako ili ave mumi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu akidichilaje na vakabitasaje hamwe na Yayilo, na vala vanu wolofu vakavafwataje, na vakamupilimaje Yesu na kumutifya. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Kaha hono iho havaga na mudala yumwe yo atamikaga wutamwa wa kuhuma danda tsa siku tsa vamama kwa myaka kumi na jivili. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Mudala uyo avaga akodiche ndalahela kwa vaganga wolofu. Hamwe na kuva avaga agutsitse finu fyolofu siapatite chiba chochive, lechelelo wutamwa wake walutilaga nachene. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa tsa Yesu, akifyatanitsaje halilugu lya vanu kuhumila kuchigosi kwa Yesu, na kudometsa mwenda go avaga afwite Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Adisile ihyo kwasawuli avaga ilonje mwene mu numbula yake kuta, “Manyi ndometse hela mwenda gwake, ngupona wutamwa wangu!” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Hoavaga kugudometsa mwenda gwa Yesu, luvala lulo danda yila yikadugaje. Akitselaje kuta aponile wutamwa wake. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Luvala lulo Yesu nayo akatselaje kuta wuvetso wake wumuponitse munu. Akavapituchilaje vala vanu wolofu na kuvaputsa, “Nani yo andomitse mwenda gwangu?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Vadahitswa vake vakamujibulaje, “Ulave vanu wolofu fyo vangukutifya. Lelo chinya ndawuli umputsa kuta nani yo akudomitse?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Lechelelo Yesu akendelelaje kupugasa ili amuwone munu yula yo amudomitse. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Iho mudala yula yo atselaga chochi muhumye, akahumilaje kuno ankakama kwa muloto na kipuna halutalo ha Yesu akamulonjelaje chila chinu cho chimuhumye. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu akamulonjelaje mudala yula, “Muhintsa, litumbilo lyako likuponitse, bitaje kwa wusichimafu. Ng'odeko yako yidutsile.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu hoavaga ankwendelela kulonga, vanu kuhuma kwa kaye ya Yayilo vakafikaje na kumulonjela Yayilo, “Muhintsa vako mwanga atajiche, lelo kwasawuli yachi unkwendelela kumukoda Mudahitsi?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Lechelelo Yesu hoavaga kuhulika ihyo akamulonjelaje yula muvina va nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, “Witumbile hela, uleche kuva na muloto.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu akavalemetsaje vanu vanji kwilongotsa hamwe nayo, lechelelo akavatolaje Petulo, na Yakobo, na Yohana yoavaga mung'olotse Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Hovavaga kufika ha nyumba ya vina va nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi yula yo achemwaga Yayilo. Vanu vavaga vanvemba na kulomboketsa. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yesu akinjilaje mu nyumba na kuvaputsa, “Kwasawuli yachi munkola na kulomboketsa? Mwana yuno siafweye ila avasise hela.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Vanu vala vakamuhekaje kwa mbedatsi. Lechelelo Yesu akavahumyaje kivala vanu veka, akavategulaje yuve na dade va muhintsa yula yo atajiche, hamwe na vala vadahitswa vake akinjilaje nawo mu chumba chila cho gwavaga muvili gwa muhintsa yula. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu akalibataje liwoko lya muhitsa yula yo atajiche, na kumulonjela, “Talita kumi!” Chinya kutijila, “Muhintsa ulamuche!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Luvala lulo muhintsa yula akatsilipukaje, akimaje na kwantsa kujenda. Muhintsa yula avaga na myaka kumi na jivili. Ihyo yuve na dade vakavaje kuluwona lulongwa ulo vakapomokaje ndalahela. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesu akavalemetsaje vanu valeche kumulonjela munu yoyuve lulongwa ulo loluhumye. Kaha akavalonjelaje yuve na dade vamupele chilyo muhintsa yula yo atsilipuche.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Vanu va ku Natsaleti vangumukana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lukasi 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu akawukaje kuhuma hono ho avaga ahele, akawuyaje hamwe na vadahitswa vake ku muji gwa Natsaleti go akalagalye. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Hoyavaga kufika Siku ya Weselo wa Vayawudi, Yesu akantsaje kuvadahitsa vanu hono hala ha nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi. Vanu wolofu yo vahulikaga Yesu cho adahitsaga vakatinukaje na kwiputsa kuta, “Mwene uyu apasile kwiya ndongwa tsino tso an'dahitsa? Mbe, luhala lwachi lwene ulu lo apelitwe munu uyu? Kaha an'dita chinya ndawuli ndongwa tsino tsinya mitinuso? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Mbe, yuno siyo yula muhongola mbawo, mwana va Maliya, na mung'olotsawo va Yakobo, na Yose, na Yuda, na Simoni? Mbe, vahatsave sivangikala hetu bahanago?” Ihyo vakavipaje ndalahela na vakalemaje kumutumba. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muloli va Mulungu ahesimilwaga na vanu chila hono, lechelelo abedalwaga ku muji gwawo, na kwa vang'olotse na ku kaye yawo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yesu siavaditye ndongwa tsotsive tsinya mitinuso kwasawuli ya mbedatsi tsawo, lechelelo avasuchye kwa kuvavichila mawoko vanu vatunga hela na kuvaponetsa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu akabubuluvaje kwasawuli ya vanu vala kulema kumutumba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu anguvatuma vadahitswa kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lukasi 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu afijendelaga fijiji fya habehi na kuvadahitsa vanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Akavachemaje vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili, akavapelaje wuvetso wa kuvinga misoka na kuvatuma vavilivavili. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Akavalajitsaje kuta, “Muleche kutolanitsa chinu chochive uko komum'bita, muleche kutegulitsa chilyo, awu libeji lya mwenda, awu magobole mu musipi gwenyu. Mutolaje ng'weku ng'ani. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mufwalaje filatu, lechelelo mulekaje kutegula mugolole gunji gwa kubadila.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Akavalonjelaje kaha, “Kaye yoyive yo mukulibulitswa, mwikalaje baho mbaka ho mukuwuka ku muji ugo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Lechelelo hono hohave manyi vanu valeme kuvalibulitsa, awu valeche kuvahulikitsa cho munguvalonjela muhume mu muji ugo, ho mukuva munhuma mukung'unaje lingundi lya mu magulu genyu, kuvalajila kuta Mulungu avalemile.” <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ihyo vala vadahitswa kumi na vavili vakawukaje, vakavavikulilaje vanu kuta valeche ndongwa tsawo ntsibi. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Vavingaga misoka myolofu na kuvabaka mafuta vatamwa wolofu na kuvaponetsa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Yohana Mubatitsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lukasi 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Muntsajila Helodi hoavaga kuhulika ndongwa tseka tsoaditaga Yesu, kwasawuli Yesu avaga mutambulwa chila hono. Vanu vanji valongaga kuta, “Yohana Mubatitsi atsilipuche kuhuma kwa wowafweye na an'dita mitinuso kwasawuli mwene yo muloli va Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Vanji valongaga, “Uyu akuva atsilipuche Eliya muloli va Mulungu.” Vamwe valongaga, “Uyu akuva yumwe va valoli va Mulungu kota vala va katali.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Lechelelo Helode avaga kuhulika ndongwa tsa Yesu, akalongaje, “Uyu yo Yohana, yo ntsamudumwe mutwi, lechelelo atsilipwiche!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Helode alontsile ihyo kwasawuli iho hamutalo mwene avaga avatumile Vimilitsi vamubate Yohana na kumuwopa mu kaye ya vawopwa. Helode adisile ihyo kwasawuli ya mudala vake yo achemwaga Helodiya yo hamutalo avaga mudala va mung'olotse Helode yo achemwaga Fwilipo. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Helode amuditye ihyo kwasawuli Yohana Mubatitsi avaga amulonje Helodi kuta, “Siyo finofu kusukula mudala va mung'olotso.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Helodiya avaga na ng'alatsi ndalahela mu numbula yake kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo, na akaganaje kumukopola Yohana, lechelelo alemwaga, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />kwasawuli Helode amwamilaga. Kaha Helode avaga na muloto kwa Yohana kwasawuli Yohana ali munu muwuya na muhagulwa kwa Mulungu. Helode aganaga kumuhulikitsa Yohana, na yivaje hoavaga kumuhulikitsa akodekaga mu numbula yake.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Siku yimwe yoyavaga siku ya wiwuko wa kuleleka kwake Helode. Mutsajila Helode akavaditilaje liwungo vavina va wutavala wake, na vavina va vimilitsi, na filongontsi va inyi yeka ya Galilaya. Ihyo ho Helodiya akapataje nyafwasi ya kumukopola Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Ihyo muhintsa va Helodiya akinjilaje mu liwungo na kwantsa kuwunga, Helode hamwe na vajentsi vake veka vakahechelelaje ndalahela hila fyo awungaga. Muntsajila Helodi akamulonjelaje muhintsa vake, “Usuche chinu chochive choun'gana na heni ngukupela.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kaha akamulonjelaje kwa kumulahila kuta, “Chinu chochive cho ukuchigana heni ngukupela, na yivaje nusu ya wuntsajila wangu ngukupela.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ihyo muhintsa yula akahumaje kivala na kumuputsa yuve, “Ngasuche chinu chachi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Nayo yuve akamulonjelaje, “Kasuche mutwi gwa Yohana Mubatitsi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Muhintsa yula akawuyaje luvilo kwa muntsajila na kumusuka, “Ntsin'gana umele sambi mu luhelo luno mutwi gwa Yohana Mubatitsi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Muntsajila Helode akakalalaje ndalahela. Lechelelo kwasawuli ya kwilaha koali ilahite na vajentsi vake yovavaga hala ha liwungo, akalemwaje kumukanila muhintsa yula. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Luvala lulo muntsajila Helode akalajitsaje mwamitsi akagulete mutwi gwa Yohana. Mwamitsi uyo akabitaje mula mu nyumba ya vawopwa akamudumulaje mutwi Yohana Mubatitsi, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />akaguletaje mutwi gula mu luhelo na kumupela muhintsa yula, nayo muhintsa akamusindichilaje yuve. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Vadahitswa va Yohana vaveye kuhulika ndongwa itso, vakabitaje na kugutegula muvili gwa Yohana na vakagutsikaje kwa kuguvika mukabuli.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvapela chilyo vanu elufu tsihanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lukasi 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Vala vatumi vakawuyaje kula koali avatumile, na kukong'asika hoali Yesu na kumulonjela ndongwa tseka tso vadisile uko na hila fyo vadahitse. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Tubite tukikale hono ha wiyeka ili mwesele chidogo.” Alontsile ihyo kwasawuli vanu wolofu vatsaga iho na kuwuka, mbaka Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vatindajilaga kulya. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ihyo vakakwinaje mutumbwi mukomi na kubita hono ha wiyeka. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Lechelelo vanu wolofu vavaga kuvawona ho vawukaga na kutsela kovam'bita. Ihyo vanu kuhuma miji jeka vakabitaje luvilo kwa magulu kula kovam'bita Yesu na vadahitswa vake, na vanu vala vakavalongolaje kufika. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu hoavaga kwika mu mutumbwi gula, akavawonaje vanu wolofu, akavawonelaje lusungu kwasawuli vavaga kota ng'olo tsotsilihela mudimi. Ihyo akantsaje kuvadahitsa ndongwa tsolofu. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Hoyavaga mumihe, vadahitswa vakabitaje kwa Yesu na kumulonjela, “Hono hano ha mbuga, na litsuva lin'nyelejeta. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Chiba uvalaje vanu iva, ili vabite ku miji na mu fijiji fya habehi vakagule filyo!” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muvapele henye filyo.” Nawo vadahitswa vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mbe, tutegule dinali miya mbili tubite tukagule mabumunda ili tuvapele vanu iva valye?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali miya mbili kwa tsihwana na mahombo ga mukolakatsi ga myetsi nane</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Muna mabumunda galinga? Mubite mukalole.” Hovavaga kulola vakamulonjelaje, “Hogali mabumunda gahanu na somba tsivili.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ihyo Yesu akavalajitsaje vadahitswa vake kuta, “Muvalonjele vanu vikalise mu misoli filundo filundo. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Nawo vanu vakikalisaje mu misoli filundo filundo fya vanu miya moja na mu filundo fya vanu hamusini.” <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Kahi Yesu akategulaje gala mabumunda gahanu na somba tsivili, akagalamilaje kilanga na kumulumba Mulungu na kugamegasa hamwe na tsila somba tsivili, akavapelaje vala vadahitswa vake vavagavasile vanu vala veka. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Nawo vanu veka vakalyaje na kiguta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Vadahitswa va Yesu vakakong'asaje filyo fyo fisije, vakapataje fitangula fikomi kumi na fivili. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Vanu wovalyeye mabumunda na somba tsila valume ng'ani vavaga kota elufu tsihanu.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'jenda muchanya mwa malenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Luvala lulo Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake vinjile mu mutumbwi valowoche kumwambu gwa lilamba valongole kubita ku Betitsayida, na mwene akasigalaje kuvalaga vanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Yesu ho avaga kuvalaga vanu vala, akabitaje aliyena ku chidunda kusala. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Hoyavaga kufika hachilo, mutumbwi mukomi gwavaga hagatinagati mwa lilamba, na Yesu avaga aliyena ku inyi ngafu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesu akavawonaje vadahitswa vake vankodeka kukwega mutela gwa mutumbwi kwasawuli ya ng'ala ngomi yavasumaga. Kwavaga kufika habehi na kwela, Yesu akabitaje kovali vadahitswa vake kuno an'jenda muchanya mwa malenga na akaganaje kuvalutila. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Hovavaga kumuwona an'jenda muchanya mwa malenga, vakakolaje kwasawuli vatijilaga kuta likuva lilayika. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Veka vakamuwonaje na vakavaje na muloto ndalahela. Luvala lulo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mwikangatse, muleche kutinuka, yo heni!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Kahi Yesu akakwinaje mu mutumbwi mukomi govali vadahitswa vake, na ng'ala yikadugaje. Vadahitswa vakapomokaje ndalahela, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kwasawuli vavaga vang'ali kutsitsela ndongwa tsa mitinuso ja gala mabumunda. Numbula tsawo tsavaga tsing'acha nalamu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvaponetsa vatamwa ku Genetsaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayo 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Vakalowokaje lilamba na kufika inyi ya Genetsaleti, vakaguwopaje mutumbwi ku luhanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Luvala lulo vavaga kwika mu mutumbwi mukomi, vanu vakamutselaje Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Vanu vala vakabitaje luvilo luvilo mu inyi yila yeka, vakavapikaje vatamwa mu saga tsawo, na kuvasindika kokuve kovahulikaga kuta Yesu ali kuko. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Chila hono ho abitaga Yesu, na yive kumiji, awu kufijiji, awu hono hohave, vanu vavavikaga vatamwa vawo mu ntsuga tsa hono ha kugutsila finu, na kumusuka Yesu idichile vatamwa iwo vibate na yive lupembo lwa mwenda gwake hela. Na chila yo amudomitse Yesu akaponaje.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga ntsovelo tsa vavina</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayo 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Siku yimwe Mafwalisayo hamwe na vadahitsi vatunga va malajitso ga Musa wo vavaga vahumye ku Yelusalemu vakakong'asikaje hono hoavaga Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Vakavawonaje vadahitswa vamwe va Yesu vankulya chinya mutsilo, kwasawuli valyaga bila kukalava finofu kota ntsovelo tsa vavina fyo tsigana, <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />kwasawuli Mafwalisayo na Vayawudi veka sivalyaga bila kukalava mawoko mbaka mufisukululu kota hila fyo vaditaga vavina vawo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Kaha sivalyaga chinu chochive cho chigutsilwe kusoko bila kwihofuga. Kaha kuna ntsovelo tsinji ntsolofu tso vanfwata, kota hila kuhofuga fikombe, na fiya, na fyombo fyo fitengenitswe kwa madini ga saba. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ho ihyo Mafwalisayo na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Mbe, kwasawuli yachi vadahitswa vako sinambe vafwate ntsovelo tsa vavina, na vankulya bila kukalava fyo yin'ganika?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Isaya muloli va Mulungu alontsile wukweli kuta henye muvapunganitsi na kota fyo yandikwe kuta, vanu iva vanyesimilaga kwa ndonga hela, lechelelo numbula tsawo tsilikutali na heni.” Alontsile kaha,<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Vafugamilaga heni bule hela, na madahitso gawo go malagitso ga vanu hela.<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Henye mugalesile malajitso ga Mulungu na kibata tsovelo tsenyu. <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu akendelelaje kuvalonjela kuta, “Henye mufitsele kuganyelebuka malajitso ga Mulungu chinya wusugu na kufwata ntsovelo tsenyu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Musa avaga alajitse kuta, walahogola kuvabedala yuwo na dado, nayo munu yoyuve yo akumuliga yuve awu dade yikuganika akopolwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Lechelelo henye mun'dahitsa vanu kuta, manyi munu ana chinu cho an'ganika kumutanga yuve awu dade, lechelelo manyi alonje chinu icho cho kolibani, chinya kutijila kuta, chinu chino chibangwelwe kwa Mulungu, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />kwakudita ihyo munguvalemetsa vanu kuvatanga valeli vawo. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ihyo henye mungutsibedala ndongwa tsa Mulungu kwasawuli ya kufwata ntsovelo tsenyu tso mwivichye. Kaha muditaga ndongwa ntsolofu tso tsihwana na itso.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Finu fyo fimuditaga munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayo 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu akavachemaje kaha vanu vala wolofu na kuvalonjela, “Munyulikitse chila munu atsele lulongwa luno lo ntsinlonga. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kuduhu chinu cho chifuluche chinjile mugati mwa munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu, lechelelo chinu cho chihumaga mugati cho chimuditaga munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Manyi munu yoyuve ana mapulichilo ga kuhulika na ahuliche lulongwa luno!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibiliya tsinji ndongola tsilihela musitali guno</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesu avaga kuwuka na kuvaleka vanu vala wolofu na kwinjila mu nyumba, vadahitswa vake vakamuputsaje mana ya sembeletso yila. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mbe, hata henye sinambemulutsele? Simuntsela kuta kuduhu chinu chochive chichinkwinjila mugati mwa munu sichifuluche chimudite munu aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Manyi munu alye chinu sichinjilaga mu numbula, kwasawuli chinjilaga mu lileme na hambele chibitaga kucholo.” Kwa kulonga ihyo, Yesu adisile chila chilyo chiliwe! <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Kaha akendelelaje kulonga, “Fila fyo finhuma mugati mwa munu fimuditaga aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Tsinlonga hino kwasawuli kuhuma mugati mwa numbula ya munu kuhumaga mahotso mabi, na wusalati, na wuhitsi, na wukopolaji, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />na waafu, na mbwiniwo ntsa mali, na wubi, na wudesi, na wusuda, na maligo, na mbwinwo tsa waafu, na chidada, na wupufi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Finu fibi ifyo fyeka fihumaga mu numbula ya munu na kumudita aleche kidichilwa na Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litumbilo lya mudala yumwe yo siavaga Muyawudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayo 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu akawukaje hono hala na kubita ku muji gwa Tilo. Akinjililaje mu nyumba yimwe, nayo siaganaga munu yoyuve atsele kuta avaga mula. Lechelelo akalemwaje kwifiha. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Kuko kwavaga na mudala yumwe yoavaga na mwana munya misoka, avaga kuhulika Yesu avaga hono iho, akabitaje hala hoavaga Yesu na kumufugamila. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Akamusukaje Yesu amuhetse mwanage misoka, lechelelo mudala uyo siavaga Muyawudi, avaga alelichilye ku Silofoiniche mu inyi ya Siliya. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu akamulonjelaje yula mudala, “Valeche vana valongole kwiguta, kwasawuli siyikuva finofu kutola filyo fya vana na kujitotsela mibwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Lechelelo mudala yula akalongaje, “Ena Mutwa chounlonga chili hihyo, lechelelo hata mibwa jojili hanyi ha metsa yo vankulya vana, jilyaga fyo finkugwa hanyi ha metsa yila.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu akamulonjelaje mudala yula, “Kwasawuli ulontsile finofu, uwuye kukaye kwako, lila lisoka mwanga limuhumile mwanago!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Mudala yula akawukaje na kubita kukaye kwake, akamufikaje mwanage avasise mu chinanda na lisoka lila mwanga limuhumile.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu chibubwi na mudibafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu akawukaje ku muji gwa Tilo akakolelaje ku Sidoni, akafikaje ku lilamba lya Galilaya na kwinjila hono ho hanchemwa Dekapoli, chinya kutijila miji kumi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Vanu vakamuletelaje Yesu munu chibubwi na kaha avaga mudibafu, vakamugongoletsaje amuvichile mawoko ili kumuponetsa. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Nayo Yesu akamutegulaje halubali ha vanu vala wolofu, na akamuvichilaje fyala mu mapulichilo ga munu yula, na kufunya mati, na kudometsa lulimi lwa munu yula. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesu akalavaje kilanga kwa Mulungu na kwigugumya kwa lusungu, na kumulonjela yula munu, “Efwata,” chinya kutijila, “Udinduche!” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Luvala lulo mapulichilo na lulimi lwa munu yula fikadindukaje, akantsaje kulonga finofu. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu akavalemetsaje vanu vala wolofu valekaje kumulonjela munu yoyuve lulongwa ulo. Lechelelo hila fyoavaga ankangala kuvalemetsa, vene nawo vakangalaga ndalahela kuvavikulila vanu lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Vanu vavaga kuhulika lulongwa ulo vakapomokaje ndalahela na kulonga, “Chila chinu cho adisile Yesu chavaga chinofu, kwasawuli avadisile vanu vadibafu vahuliche na vabubwi valonje!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvapela chilyo vanu elufu tsitayi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayo 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Chipindi icho vanu wolofu vakakong'asikaje kaha. Na kwasawuli vanu vala vavaga valihela filyo, Yesu akavachemaje vadahitswa vake na kuvalonjela, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Ntsinguvawonela lusungu vanu vano, kwasawuli vikalise na heni kwa siku tsidatu na valihela chilyo. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Manyi ntsivaleche vabite ku kaye kwawo na ntsala, na vamwe vahumye kutali yifuluche yivatove mbupulu mung'asi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Vadahitswa vake vakamuputsaje, “Hano ha mbuga, tukupata kwiya filyo fyo vafuluche vigute vanu veka vano?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Munago mabumunda galinga?” Vakamulonjelaje, “Tunago mabumunda saba.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vanu vikalise hasi. Akagategulaje gala mabumunda saba, akamulumbaje Mulungu, akagamegasaje na kuvapela vadahitswa vake vavagavasile vanu. Vadahitswa vakavagavasilaje vanu kota fyo alontsile Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Hihila vali na tusomba tudodo. Yesu akafitambichilaje na kuvalajitsa hihila vadahitswa vake vavagavile vanu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Vala vanu vakalyaje na kwiguta. Hambele vadahitswa vakaholangitsaje mabumunda na somba tso tsisije, fikamemaje fitangula saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Nawo vanu yo valyeye vavaga kota elufu tsitayi. Duve Yesu akavalagaje vanu vabite kukaye kwawo, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />na luvala lulo akakwinaje mu mutumbwi hamwe na vadahitswa vake akabitaje ku muji gwa Dalumanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafwalisayo van'gana ndajilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Mafwalisayo vatunga vakatsaje na kwantsa kumuputsa Yesu. Vakamujelaje kwa kumulonjela avaditile ndajilo tsa kulajila kuta mwene ahumye kilanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Lechelelo Yesu hoavaga kuluhulika lulongwa ulo akakalalaje munumbula na kuvalonjela, “Kwasawuli yachi chilelo chino chin'gana ndajilo? Ntsinguvalonjela nachene, chilelo chino sichikupelwa ndajilo yoyive.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Hoavaga kuvalonjela ihyo, Yesu akavalekaje Mafwalisayo na kukwina kaha mutumbwi hamwe na vadahitswa vake, vakalowokaje kumwambu gwa lilamba.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafwalisayo na lya Helodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayo 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Vadahitswa va Yesu vavaga vasemwe kutegula mabumunda molofu, vali vatweye libumunda limwe hela mu mutumbwi gula. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu akavafundaje vadahitswa vake kwa kuvalonjela, “Mwiyangalile ndalahela na lisimika lya Mafwalisayo na ya Helodi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Vadahitswa vakantsaje kulongana vene kwa vene kuta, “Anlonga hino kwasawuli situlategula mabumunda.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu akatselaje cho valongana, akavalonjelaje, “Kwasawuli yachi munlongana kuta mulihela mabumunda? Mbe, mung'acha kutsela awu kulukagula? Mbe, numbula tsenyu tsing'acha nalamu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mbe, munago miho lechelelo munlemwa kulava? Munago mapulichilo lechelelo sinambe muhuliche? Mbe, sinambe mwiwuche <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />chipindi chila fyo ntsamegasise gala mabumunda gahanu na kuvapela vanu elufu tsihanu? Vamwe vahumye kutali, mwakong'ise fitangula filinga fyo fyamemile filyo fyo fisije?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Vakamulonjelaje, “Twakong'ise fitangula kumi na fivili.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kaha, “Na hala ho ntsamegasise mabumunda saba na kuvalisa vanu vala elufu tsitayi, mwakong'ise fitangula filinga fyo fyamemile filyo fyo fisije?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Vakamulonjelaje, “Twakong'ise fitangula saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Kahi akavaputsaje, “Mbe, mung'acha mutsele?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa munu chibofu ku Betisayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vakafikaje ku muji gwa Betisayida. Vanu vakamuletaje munu chibofu na vakamugongoletsaje Yesu amudometse ili amuponetse. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu akamubataje liwoko yula munu na kumulongotsa mbaka kivala na muji. Akamufunyilaje mati mumiho na kumuvichila mawoko, na kumuputsa, “Ndawuli unguchiwona chinu chochive?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Yula chibofu akamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Ntsinguvawona vanu, lechelelo, ntsinguvawona kota mibichi fyo van'jenda.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ihyo Yesu akawilaje kumuvichila mawoko kumiho, munu yula akafutulaje miho kulava na miho ga munu yula gakavaje mumi, akavetsaje kulava chila chinu finofu. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu akamulonjelaje yula munu, “Leche kwinjila ku muji kumulonjela munu yoyuve, lechelelo ubite kukaye kwako.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo angihala Yesu kuta yo Chilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lukasi 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakabitaje ku fijiji fya Kayisalia Fwilipi. Hovavaga mung'asi Yesu akavaputsaje vadahitswa vake kuta, “Vanu vanlonga kuta heni tsi nani?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Vadahitswa vake vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Vamwe vanlonga kuta heve uli Yohana Mubatitsi, na vanji vanlonga heve uli Eliya muloli va Mulungu, na vamwe vanlonga kuta heve uli yumwe va valoli va Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Lechelelo henye ndawuli, munlonga kuta heni ntsili nani?” Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Heve yo Chilisito.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ihyo Yesu akavafundaje valeche kumulonjela munu yoyuve, kuta heni yo Chilisito.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'longa fyo akukodeka, na kufwa, na kutsilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lukasi 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesu akantsaje kuvadahitsa vadahitswa vake kuta yin'ganika Heni Mwana va Munu ng'odeche kwa ng'odeko ntsolofu na kulemwa na vavina, na vavina va vatawula nambiko, na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa. Kaha ngukopolwa na siku ya kadatu ngutsilipuka. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu alontsile ndongwa itso bila kuvafiha, ihyo Petulo akamukwegaje kulubali na kwantsa kumung'anulila. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Lechelelo Yesu akapitukaje na kuvalava vadahitswa vake, akamung'anulilaje Petulo kwa kumulonjela, “Wuye kumbele kwa heni, uli Lihoka! Numbula yako sinambe yihotse ndongwa tsa Mulungu, yinhotsa ndongwa tsa vanu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Kahi Yesu akavachemaje vanu wolofu vakihantsaje hamwe na vadahitswa vake, akavalonjelaje, “Manyi munu yoyuve yo an'gana atse kwa heni, an'ganika ikane mwene na idichile kukodeka na yivaje kufwa na fwate heni.” <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Munu yoyuve yo an'gana kuwukulusa wumi wake akuwuyatsa, lechelelo yoyuve yo akuwuyatsa wumi wake kwasawuli ya heni na kwasawuli ya Ndongwa Nofu, akuwukulusa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mbe, yifuluche yimufwaye chinu chachi munu manyi afipate finu fyeka fya mu inyi na kuwuyatsa wumi wake? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Awu munu akutawula chinu chachi cho chikupilula wumi wake? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Manyi munu yoyuve ambonele nyoni heni na ndongwa tsangu, mu chilelo chino cha vanu yovan'dita ndongwa ntsibi, na Heni Mwana va Munu ngumukana munu uyo, iho ho nguwuya kuhuma kwa Dadangu kwa wumelemo hamwe na vatantsi vangu vahagulwa va kilanga.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu akawilaje kuvalonjela, “Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli, kuna vanu vamwe yovali hano yo sivakufwa mbaka ho vakuwuwona Wuntsajila wa Mulungu hila ho wunkutsa kwa wuwetso.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'woneka mu wumelemo wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lukasi 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku sita, Yesu akavategulaje Petulo, na Yakobo, na Yohana akakwinaje nawo kuchidunda chitali, na vakavaje valiyena. Kuko, Yesu akagalukaje kumiho kuno vangumulava, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />na myenda joafwite jikamelemaje na kuva myelu tswee! Kuduhu munu yoyuve va muinyi yoafuluche kufuva jive kota fyojili. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Luvala lulo vala vadahitswa vadatu vakavawonaje Eliya na Musa valoli va Mulungu, vakantsaje kulongana na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi, yikuva finofu hetwe twikale hono hano. Chiba tutsenje fyuwo fidatu, chuwo chimwe chive cha heve, na chimwe cha Musa, na chinji chive cha Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petulo akahabukaje chinya ihyo kwasawuli siatselaga alonje chinu chachi, kwasawuli mwene na vayage vali na mutinuko ndalahela. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Simusika likahumilaje lifuluka likavagubikaje, na litsi lya Mulungu kuhuma mu lifuluka likalongaje, “Uyu yo Mwanangu yo ntsimuganile. Mumuhulikitsaje!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Baho baho hovavaga kupugasa, sivamuwene munu yunji yoyuve, lechelelo Yesu ng'ani alihamwe nawo. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Hovavaga vankwika kuchidunda, Yesu akavafundaje kwa kuvalonjela kuta, valekaje kumulonjela munu yoyuve ndongwa tso vatsiwene, mbaka mwene Mwana va Munu hoakuva atsilipuche. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ihyo vakatsivikaje ndongwa itso mu numbula tsawo, lechelelo vakavaje vanlongana vene kwa vene kuta, “Kutsilipuka cho chinu chachi?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Vadahitswa vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Kwasawuli yachi vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa valongaga, yin'ganika Eliya muloli va Mulungu amulongole Chilisito?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ena, yin'ganika Eliya alongole kutsa ili aviche finofu chila chinu. Lechelelo kwasawuli yachi yandikwe mu Mandiko mahagulwa kuta, mwene Mwana va Munu an'ganika kukodwa ndalahela na kubedalwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Lechelelo ntsinguvalonjelani henye, Eliya mwanga atsitse, nawo vamuditye fyo van'gana vene, na kota hila fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eliya mwanga antsintse, Yesu anhwanitsa Eliya na Yohana mubatitsi adisile katsi yo vihuvilaga Vayawudi kuta Eliya akudiyidita, katsi iyo yavaga ya kumuditila Yesu ng'asi changa'ani</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa mukwamitsi munya lisoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Lukasi 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vala vadatu hovavaga kuwuya kuhuma ku chidunda, vakavawonaje vanu wolofu vavapilime vala vadahitswa vanji, na vadahitsi vamwe va malajitso ga Musa valonganaga nawo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Luvala lulo vala vanu wolofu vaveye kumuwona Yesu vakatinukaje ndalahela na vakamubilimilaje kumusamusa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu akavaputsaje vadahitswa, “Munsumwana chinu chachi na iva?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Munu yumwe kuhuma ha vanu vala akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi, ntsikanguletye mwana vangu ana lisoka lyo lingumudita alemwe kulonga. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Chila chipindi ho lingumutachila limugwisaga hasi na kumuhumya mifulo kumulomo, na kugwegwetsula mino na kukala ngwaa! Ntsivalonje vadahitswa vako valihetse, valemulwe!” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Henye vanu va chilelo cho chigaya litumbilo! Ngikala na henye mbaka hanili? Nguvafumilila mbaka hanili? Mundetele heni mukwamitsi uyo!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Nawo vakamuletelaje yula mukwamitsi, lechelelo lisoka lila lyavaga kumuwona Yesu, likamutovaje chinjilisa mukwamitsi yula na kumugwisa hasi, akagalawukaje hasi na kuhuma mifulo ku mulomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu akamuputsaje dade va mukwamitsi yula, “Mbe, mwanago aveye hino kuhuma hanili?” Akamulonjelaje, “Kuhuma ha wana! <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mala ntsongofu limutotsaga mu moto awu mu malenga ili limukopole. Lechelelo manyi unvetsa kudita chinu chochive tunsuka utuwonele lusungu na kututanga.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Kwasawuli yachi unlonga kuta manyi unvetsa! Fyeka fivaga kwa munya litumbilo.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Luvala lulo dade va yula mukwamitsi akakolaje kwa kulonga, “Ntsinalyo litumbilo! Lechelelo unanje ntsive na litumbilo likomi!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu avaga kuwona vanu wolofu vankong'ana, akaling'anulilaje lisoka lila, “Heve lisoka yo ungumudita mukwamitsi yuno ave na wudibafu na wububwi, umuhume mukwamitsi yuno na uleche kumwinjila kaha!” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Lisoka lila likakolaje na kumutova chinjilisa, na likamuhumaje mukwamitsi yula. Mukwamitsi akavaje kota afweye, ihyo vanu wolofu vakalongaje kuta, “Afweye!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Lechelelo Yesu akamubataje liwoko na kumwinula, nayo akimaje. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu ho avaga kwinjila mu nyumba, vadahitswa vake hovavaga valiyena vakamuputsaje, “Kwasawuli yachi hetwe tulemulwe kulihetsa lisoka lila?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Lisoka linya hila silifuluche lihume, lechelelo kwa kulongola kumusuka Mulungu tandi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'wila kulonga fyo akukopolwa na kutsilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Lukasi 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakawukaje hono iho, vakakolelaje ku Galilaya. Yesu siaganaga munu yoyuve atsele kovali, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kwasawuli avaga avadahitse vadahitswa vake. Avaga avalonje kuta, “Heni Mwana va Munu ngupitukwa na kibatika mu mawoko ga vanu nawo vakung'opola, lechelelo siku ya kadatu kuhuma ng'opolwe, ngutsilipuka.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Lechelelo vadahitswa vake sivalutselye lulongwa ulo loalontsile Yesu, na vakavaje na muloto kumuputsa.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nani yo akuva muvina</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lukasi 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Yesu na vadahitswa vake hovavaga kufika ku Kapelinaumu na kwinjila mu nyumba, Yesu akavaputsaje vadahitswa vake, “Chichi cho mwisumanije kung'asi kula?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Lechelelo vene vakakatukaje, kwasawuli mung'asi vasumanaga kuta nani yo akuva muvina hagati hetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu akikalisaje hasi, akavachemaje vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili na kuvalonjela, “Manyi munu yoyuve an'gana ave mulongola, an'ganika ave va mwiso na ave mutantsi va veka.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ihyo Yesu akamutegulaje mwana mudodo na kumwimya hagati hawo, akamukumbanitsaje na kuvalonjela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Munu yoyuve yo akumulibulitsa mwana yumwe mudodo kota vana iva kwasawuli yangu, akuva andibulitse heni. Nayo yoyuve yo akundibulitsa heni, akuva amulibulitse Mulungu yo anumile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu yosinambe tutelane alilikuga na hetwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Lukasi 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi, tumuwene munu yumwe angujing'anulila misoka kwa Litawa lyako, hetwe tukamulemetsaje kwasawuli mwene siali likuga na hetwe.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Lechelelo Yesu akalongaje, “Mulekaje kumulemetsa munu yo an'dita kota ihyo. Kuduhu munu yoyuve yoafuluche adite ndongwa tsinya mitinuso kwa Litawa lyangu, kaha luvala lulo antse kundonga fibi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Munu yoyuve yosinambe atelane na hetwe ali lubali lwetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nachene ntsinguvalonjelani kuta, manyi munu yoyuve avapele chikombe cha malenga ga kung'wa kwasawuli henye mu vanu va Chilisito, nachene munu uyo akwanuchila ngweko kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Finu fyo finkwambutsa munu adite ndongwa ntsibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lukasi 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Lechelelo manyi munu yoyuve yo akumwambutsa yumwe va vadodo iva adite ndongwa tsibi, yikuva chiba munu uyo vamuwopeletse lwala lukomi musingo yake na kutotswa mu bahali. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Manyi liwoko lyako likwambutse kudita ndongwa ntsibi, chiba ulidumule. Yikuva chiba heve winjile ku wumi wowugaya wudugo kuno ulihela liwoko limwe, kuliko kuva na mawoko gavili lechelelo ubite ku moto go sigutsimaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Kuko kojili mifuntsa josinambe jilalile na moto, na kaha ugo moto gwene sigutsimikaga. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibiliya ntsinji tsa katali tsilihela misitali jino ja 43 na 44</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Manyi ligulu lyako likwambutse kudita ndongwa ntsibi, chiba ulidumule. Yikuva chiba heve winjile ku wumi wa Mulungu kuno ulihela ligulu limwe, kuliko kuva na magulu gavili lechelelo ubite ku moto go sigutsimikaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Kuko kuna mifuntsa josinambe jilalile na moto, na kaha ugo moto gwene sigutsimikaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Manyi liho lyako likwambutse kudita ndongwa ntsibi, chiba ulikolopole. Yikuva chiba heve winjile ku wumi wo wugaya wudugo kuno ulihela liho limwe, kuliko kuva na miho gavili, lechelelo ubite ku moto go sigutsimikaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Kuko kuna mifuntsa josinambe jilalile na moto, na kaha ugo moto gwene sigutsimikaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Mulungu akumulutitsa chila munu mu ng'odeko, kota hila vanu fyo vabakaga mwino mu nyama kabla ya kuyilalitsa. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mwino guvaga munofu hala hogung'acha na lwiha, lechelelo manyi guyatse lwiha lwake gukubadilwa na chinu chachi? Nanye muvaje kota mwino gogunkola, mwelewane henye kwa henye.<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dahitsa madahitso ga kitola na kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lukasi 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu akawukaje ku Kapelinaumu, akalowokaje lulenga lwa Yolidani na kubita ku Yudeya. Vanu wolofu vakatsaje hoali, nayo akantsaje kuvadahitsa kota hila fyo aditaga siku tsinji. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Mafwalisayo vamwinga vakabitaje kwa Yesu ili vamujele, vakamupuntsaje kuta, “Mbe, malajitso getu galajitse kuta mulume afuluche amuleche mudala vake?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Musa avalajitse chinu chachi?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Nawo vakamulonjelaje, “Musa atulajitse kuta, mulume afuluche amwandichile vake litatasi lya kulekana na kumuleka.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Musa avandichilye lilajitso ilyo kwasawuli ya wutalamu wenyu wa kuhulikitsa madahitso. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Lechelelo kuhuma kuwumbwa kwa inyi, Mulungu awumbite munu mulume na munu mudala. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ihyo mulume akuvaleka yuve na dade na vakwihantsa na vake, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />na iwo vavili vakuva muvili gumwe na si vavili kaha. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Duve, chinu chila cho achihantsitse Mulungu, munu alekaje kuchilekanitsa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Yesu hoavaga kwinjila munyumba, vadahitswa vake vakamuputsaje lulongwa ulo lwa kulekana. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mulume yo akulekana na mudala vake na kumutola mudala yunji, akuva an'dita waafu na mudala yula. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Hihyo na mudala yo akulekana na mulume vake na kutoleka na mulume yunji, akuva an'dita waafu na yula mulume yunji.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvatambichila vana vadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lukasi 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Siku yimwe vanu vamwe vanya vana, vakamusindichilaje Yesu vana vawo ili avatambichile na kuvavichila mawoko. Lechelelo vadahitswa vake vakavang'anulilaje. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu hoavaga kuluwona lulongwa ulo akavipaje na kuvalonjela vadahitswa vake, “Muvaleche vana vadodo vatse kwa heni, mulekaje kuvalemetsa, kwasawuli Wuntsajila wa Mulungu ni kwasawuli ya vanu yo vanakota vana iva vadodo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli, munu yoyuve yosinambe awanuchile Wuntsajila wa Mulungu kota mwana mudodo fyo anguwanuchila, sialahogola injile!” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Yesu akavategulaje vana iwo na kuvakumbanitsa, akavavichilaje mawoko na kuvatambichila.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu yumwe mufuchifu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lukasi 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu hoavaga kwantsa lujendo lwa kuwuka ku Yelusalemu, munu yumwe akamubilimilaje na kumufugamila akamuputsaje, “Mudahitsi muwuya, ntsin'ganika ndite chinu chachi ili mate wumi wo wugaya wudugo?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu akamulonjelaje yula munu, “Kwasawuli yachi un'nyema heni muwuya? Kuduhu munu yoyuve yo muwuya lechelelo Mulungu ng'ani.” <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ugatsele malajitso ga Mulungu kuta, “Uleche kukopola, uleche waafu, uleche kuhitsa, uleche kulonga wusahidi wa wudesi, uleche wudesi, uvahesimilaje dado na yuwo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Yula munu akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi, malagitso geka ntsigatsele luhuma tsing'acha ntsi mukwamitsi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu akamulavaje na kumugana munu yula, akamulonjelaje kuta, “Kuna chinu chimwe cho chisije. Ubite ukagutse finu fyeka fyo unafyo, na magobole go ukugapata, uvapele vagayu, na heve ukuva wivichye hachiba kilanga kwa Mulungu, kahi manyi udite ihyo utse ufwate heni.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Munu yula hoavaga kuhulika ihyo, akakalalaje na kuwuka kwa wususutafu, kwasawuli avaga na mali ntsolofu.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu akapugasaje, na kuvalonjela vadahitswa vake, “Lukuva lulongwa lutalamu ndalahela kwa vafuchifu kwinjila mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Vadahitswa vake vakapomokaje kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo loalontsile Yesu. Lechelelo Mwene akavalonjelaje kahi kuta, “Vadahitswa vangu yo ntsinguvagana, mulave hila fyo kukuva kutalamu ndalahela kwa vanu kwinjila mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Kwasawuli lukuva lulongwa lupefu kwa linyama lyolinchemwa ngamiya kupuluta mu linang'ana lya sing'ano, kuliko munu mufuchifu kwinjila mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Vadahitswa vake vakatinukaje ndalahela na kwiputsa, “Kwa ndongwa itso nani yoafuluche akuluche?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu akavakangatsilaje miho vadahitswa vake na kuvalonjela, “Lulongwa ulo lutalamu kwa vanu, lechelelo kwa Mulungu siluli ihyo ndaya. Kwasawuli chila ndongwa tsivaga mefu kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Hetwe tulesile chila chinu na kukufwata heve!” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, chila munu yoakuleka nyumba, awu muhatsave, awu yuve, awu dade, awu vanage, awu migunda kwasawuli ya heni awu kwasawuli ya Ndongwa Nofu, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />akupelwa hilo finu buluta mu inyi, na kaha akupelwa na nyumba tsolofu, na vamame, na vahatsave, na yuve, na vana, na migunda, na ng'odeko, kahi akupelwa wumi wowugaya wudugo ku inyi yila yoyinkutsa. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Lechelelo vanu wolofu yo valongola vakuva va kuwudugo, na vala va kuwudugo vakuva valongola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga lwa kadatu kuta akukopolwa na kutsilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lukasi 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake hovavaga mung'asi vam'bita ku Yelusalemu, akavalongolaje kulutalo. Vadahitswa vake vakapomokaje, nawo vanu yo vavaga hamwe nawo vakavaje na muloto. Yesu akavategulaje vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili na kubita nawo halubali na kuvalonjela chinu cho chikumupata. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Akavalonjelaje, “Muhulikitse, tusogwe ku Yelusalemu, uko heni Mwana va Munu ngupitukwa na kusindikwa kwa vavina va vatawula nambiko, na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa. Iwo vakunyiga ng'opolwe na vakundeka kwa vanu yosi Vayawudi, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />vanu iwo vakumbedala na kufunyila mati, kaha vakunova na kung'opola. Lechelelo siku ya kadatu ngutsilipuka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na Yohana vangumusuka Yesu wuvina</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Yakobo na Yohana yovavaga vana va Tsebedayo, vakatsaje kwa Yesu na kumulonjela, “Mudahitsi, tun'gana utuditile lulongwa lo tunsuka.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu akavapuntsaje, “Mun'gana tsivaditile chinu chachi?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Nawo vakamulonjelaje, “Hala houkuva wichite muchigoda chako cha Wuntsajila, utudichidile hetwe yumwe ikale kuliwoko lyako lililo na yunji ikale kuliwoko lyako lichiji.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje kuta, “Henye sinambe muchitsele cho munsuka. Mbe, henye mufuluche mukodeche kota fyo ngukodeka heni, na kukopolwa kota fyo ngukopolwa heni?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Yakobo na Yohana vakamulonjelaje Yesu, “Ena, tufuluche!” Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mufuluche mukodeche kota fyo ngukodeka heni? Awu mufuluche mukopolwe kota fyo ngukopolwa heni. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Lechelelo lulongwa lwenyu ulo lwa kikala lubali lwa liwoko lililo awu lichiji ulo sifuluche manje heni ndaya. Mulungu mwene akuvapela vala yo avahagwe.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Vala vadahitswa kumi wovasije ho vavaga kuhulika lulongwa ulo, vakavavipilaje Yakobo na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Ihyo Yesu akavachemaje vadahitswa vake veka na kuvalonjela, “Muntsela kuta vatavala wo sivayawudi vavatavalaga vanu kwa wudadambafu, vavatavalaga chinya ihyo kuvalajila vanu wuvetso wawo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Lechelelo kwa henye yivaje finji, yula yoan'ghana ave muvina kwa henye, an'ganika ave mutantsi venyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Munu yoyuve yoan'gana ave mulongola kwenyu, an'ganika ave mutantsi venyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Nambe heni Mwana va Munu sintsitsitse numichilwe, lechelelo ntsitsitse ntsivatanje vanu na kuwutawula wumi wangu wuve mahombo ga kuvagombola vanu wolofu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuponetsa Batimayo yoavaga chibofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lukasi 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakinjilaje ku muji gwa Yeliko. Hovavaga van'wuka ku muji ugo hamwe na vanu wolofu, munu yumwe yoavaga abofwe achemwaga Batimayo mwana va Timayo, avaga ichite halubali ha ng'asi asukaga vanu vamupele chinu chochive. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Batimayo avaga kuhulika kuta Yesu va ku Natsaleti anlutila hono iho, akakolaje, “Bee Yesu Mwana va mutsajila Dawudi, umbonele lusungu na kunanga!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Vanu wolofu vakamulemetsaje aleche kukola, lechelelo mwene akakalalilaje kukola kuta, “Bee Mwana va muntsajila Dawudi, umbonele lusungu na kunanga!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu akimaje na kulonga, “Mumucheme atse!” Vanu vakamuchemaje yula chibofu, vakamulonjelaje, “Wikangatse numbula! Wime, Yesu angukuchema!” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Batimayo akadibulaje mugolole gwake, akadibukaje mwilanga mwilanga kubita kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu akamuputsaje, “Chinu chachi cho un'gana nguditile?” Yula munu yo abofwe akamulonjelaje, “Mudahitsi tsinsuka mbetse kulola.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Bite, litumbilo lyako likuponitse.” Luvala lulo yula munu chibofu akalavaje na kwantsa kumufwata Yesu mung'asi.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ankwinjila ku Yelusalemu kwa liwungo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lukasi 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vavaga habehi na muji gwa Yelusalemu, vakafikaje kufijiji fya Besifwage na Betsaniya, habehi na chidunda cha Mitseyituni. Yesu akavatumaje vadahitswa vake vavili valongole, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Mubite ku chijiji cha kulutalo. Homukuva munkwinjila, mukuyifika ntsana ya ntsove yiwopitwe yo ying'ali kukwinwa na munu yoyuve ayijendele. Muyiwopole na kundetela. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Manyi munu avaputse kuta kwasawuli yachi munguyiwopola? Henye mukumulonjele kuta Mutwa anguyigana, na hambele akuyipilula.” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Vala vadahitsi vavili vakawukaje, vakayifikaje ntsana ya ntsove yiwopitwe mulubali mwa ng'asi, habehi na lwitsi lwa nyumba. Hovavaga vanguyiwopola yila ntsove, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />vanu vatunga yovavaga hono hala vakavaputsaje, “Henye mun'dita chinu chachi iho? Kwasawuli yachi munguyiwopola ntsana ya ntsove?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Vala vadahitswa va Yesu vakavalonjelaje kota hila fyo aka avalonje Yesu. Vanu vala vakavalekaje vategule na kuwuka nayo yila ntsana ya ntsove. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Vakayisindikaje yila ntsana ya ntsove kwa Yesu, na vakatandikaje migolole jawo muchanya mwa yila ntsana ya ntsove na Yesu akikalaje muchanya mwa mugongo gwake. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Vanu wolofu vakatandikaje myenda jawo mu ng'asi, na vanji vakatandatsaje miputi jovali vakwanyulansile mumigunda ili kumuhesimila Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Vanu vakalongolaje, na vanji vakavaje kumbele, na Yesu akavaje hagati, na vanu veka vakatovaje chiyove kwa kulonga, “Atsumitswe Mulungu! Uyu yo aditilwe wuwuya na Mulungu yo ankutsa kwa Litawa lya Mutwa! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Mulungu awuditye wuwuya Wuntsajila wowunkutsa wa dada vetu Dawudi. Ntsumitso tsina Mulungu va kilanga ndalahela!” <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu akinjilaje ku Yelusalemu na akabitaje ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, akalavaje chila chinu kwa kuchihima. Lechelelo akawukaje hamwe na vadahitswa vake akawuyaje ku Betsaniya kwasawuli yavaga mumihe.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angulikotola libichi lya mutini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayo 21:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Hamitondo iyage hamilawu Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake hovavaga vanhuma ku Betsaniya kubita ku Yelusalemu, Yesu akavaje na ntsala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Yesu hoavaga kulava kwa kutali, akaguwonaje mubichi gwa mutini gutinive mihamba myolofu. Akahejelelaje ili abave libawo lyolive, avaga kufika akawonaje mihamba ng'ani, kwasawuli sichavaga chipindi cha mibawo. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesu akagulonjelaje mubichi gula, “Kuhuma sambi na siku tseka, siukulela mibawo jojive!” Nawo vadahitswa vake vakahulikaje hila fyo agukotolaga.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anvinga vanu ha luga lwa Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lukasi 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake hovavaga kufika ku Yelusalemu, Yesu akinjilalaje ha luga lwa Nyumba ya Mulungu na kwantsa kuvavinga vanu yo vagutsaga na kugula finu hono iho. Akabindulangaje metsa tsa vala yo vafuntsaga magobole, kaha akabindulangaje figoda fya vanu yo vagutsaga ng'unda. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Yesu akalemetsaje vanu valeche kutegula chinu chochive kuhuma hala ha Nyumba ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Kaha akavadahitsaje, “Mbe, Siyandikwe kuta Mulungu alontsile, Nyumba yangu yikuchemwa Nyumba ya Kusalila vanu veka? Lechelelo henye muyidisile kuva malika ya mawumiyani.” <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Vavina va vatawula nambiko na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, vakantsaje kusaka hila fyo vakumukopola Yesu. Lechelelo vamwogopaga, kwasawuli vanu veka vapomokaga hila Yesu fyo adahitsaga finofu. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Hoyavaga kufika mumihe, Yesu na vadahitswa vake vakawukaje kuhuma Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cho tungidahitsa kuhuma kwa libichi lya mutini go gukatsile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Hamilawu iyage hovavaga vanlutila hala ha mubichi gwa mutini, vakaliwonaje lila libichi lyeka likatsile kwantsila mu ndela. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petulo akiwukaje chila cho avaga alontsile Yesu na kumulonjela kuta, “Mudahitsi lave! Gula mubichi gwa mutini go ukagukotwe gukatsile!” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Mumutumbilaje Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli kuta, manyi munu achilonjele chidunda chino, gumbuche na wikitotse mu bahali, na kuno alihela muhwehwe goguve munumbula yake na kaha angitumbila kuta yikuva hihila kota fyo alontsile, akuditilwa lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ihyo ntsinguvalonjela, hala ho munsala na kusuka chinu chochive kwa Mulungu, mwitumbilaje kuta mwanuchye, nanye mukuva mupasile. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Nanye chila homukuva munsala, mun'ganika mumuhulumile munu lulongwa loluve lo avakosye, nayo Dada venyu va kilanga avahulumile na henye ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Lechelelo manyi henye muleche kuvahulumila vanu, na Dada venyu va kilanga siakuvahulumila na henye ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibiliya tsinji tsa katali tsilihela musitali guno</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anwutswa wuvetso wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lukasi 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakafikaje kaha ku Yelusalemu. Yesu hoavaga an'jenda ha luga lwa Nyuma ya Mulungu, vavina va vatawula nambiko, na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, na vavina va muji vakatsaje, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />na kumuputsa, “Ndongwa tsila tso un'dita chila siku, un'dita kwa wuvetso wachi? Nani yo akupelye wuvetso wa kudita ndongwa itso?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu akavajibulaje, “Nguvaputsa lulongwa lumwe manyi munjibule na heni nguvalonjela ntsin'dita ndongwatsino kwa wuvetso wa nani. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Mundonjele kuta wuvetso wa Yohana kubatitsa vanu wahumye kwa Mulungu awu kwa vanu?” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Vakantsaje kulongana vene kwa vene, “Manyi tulonje kuta wahumye kwa Mulungu, akutuputsa kuta mbona simwamutumbye Yohana Mubatitsi? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Lechelelo kaha manyi tulonje kuta, wahumye kwa vanu, vanu vakutuvipila.” Vawogopaga vala vanu, kwasawuli vanu veka vatselaga kuta Yohana avaga muloli va Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ihyo vakamulonjelaje Yesu kuta, “Hetwe sinamnbe tutsele.” Nayo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Na heni singuvalonjela kuta ntsin'dita ndongwa tsino kwa wuvetso wa nani.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahwanitsa filongotsi va Vayawudi na valimi vawumiyani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lukasi 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Hambele Yesu akantsaje kuvadahitsa vanu kwa mihwano kuta, “Munu yumwe avaga alimile mugunda gwa mitsabibu. Akapilimyaje lwigo mugunda gweka, na hagati akayavaje hono ha kukamila tsabibu, na kaha akatsengaje chuwo chitali cha munala cha kwamilila mugunda gweka. Akagukodisaje mugunda gula kwa valimi vanji na mwene akabitaje ku inyi yinji. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Hoyavaga kufika chipindi cha kubeta tsabibu, akamutumaje mupogotsi vake abite kwa vala valimi va mugunda gwa mitsabibu ili vamupele tsabibu kwasawuli ya mahombo gwa mugunda gwake. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Lechelelo vala valimi vakamubataje mupogotsi yula na kumutova, na vakamuvingaje bila chinu chochive. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Yula munya mugunda akamutumaje mupogotsi yunji kwa vala valimi, lechelelo vala valimi vakamukonaje kumutwi na kumuditila ndongwa tsa kumuhonjela nyoni. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Hambele yula munya mugunda akamutumaje mutantsi yunji, uyo valamwe kumukopola. Kaha avatumile na vatantsi vanji wolofu, vala valimi vakavatovaje na vamwe vakavakopolaje. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Yula munya mugunda avaga asije na mwanage yumwe yo amuganaga ndalahela. Hawudugo akamutumaje uyo kuno anhontsa kuta, vakumuhulikitsa kwasawuli yuno mwanangu. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Lechelelo vala valimi vaveye kumuwona mwana va munya mugunda, vakalonganaje kuta, yuno yo muhali va mugunda guno, ino lelo tumukopole ili mugunda guno guve gwa hetwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ihyo vakamubataje na kumukopola na kumutotsa kivala kwa mugunda gwa mitsabibu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesu akavaputsaje, “Munhotsa kuta yula munya mugunda ho akuvakutsa akuvadita chinu chachi vala valimi? Akuntsa na kuvakopola vala valimi veka na kuvapela vanu vanji gula mugunda gwa mitsabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Mbe, simwasomile mandiko ga Mulungu gogandikwe kuta, liganga lya kutsenjela lyo valilemile vatsentsi, liveye liganga likomi lyolin'ganika kulongola kutsenjela kulutila maganga geka? <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Mutwa Mulungu yo adisile lulongwa ulu lwa kutinusa mu miho getu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Vatawula nambiko na vavina va Chiyawudi hamwe na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, vakatselaje kuta ugo muhwano Yesu anguvasembeletsela vene. Vakaganaje kumubata vamuwope, lechelelo vakawonaje muloto kwasawuli ya vanu vala wolofu yo vali hono hala. Duve vakamulekaje Yesu hono iho vene vakawukaje.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anwutswa ndongwa tsa kodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lukasi 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Hambele Mafwalisayo vamwinga hamwe na vafwasi va Helode vali vatumilwe ili kumuhulikitsa Yesu manyi alonje chinu chibi chochive vamubate. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Vala yo vatumilwe vakatsaje kwa Yesu na kumuputsa, “Mudahitsi, tuntsela kuta heve uli munu muwuya na unlonga wukweli na kudahitsa hila fyoan'gana Mulungu, na siumwogopaga munu yoyuve. Mbe, tun'ganika kuhomba kodi kwa Muntsajila va Loma tuhombe awu tuleche kuhomba?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Lechelelo Yesu akatselaje wupunganitsi wawo, akavalonjelaje, “Kwasawuli yachi mun'njela? Mundajile ilyo ligobole lyo linchemwa dinali.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Vakamulajilaje Yesu lila ligobole, nayo akavaputsaje, “Sula iyi na litawa ili fihwana na nani?” Vakamulonjelaje, “Fihwana na Muntsajila va Loma.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Fya Muntsajila va Loma mumpele Muntsajila va Loma, na fya Mulungu mumupele Mulungu.” Vaveye kuhulika ihyo, vakapomokaje.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu an'dahitsa ndongwa tsa kutsilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lukasi 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Masadukayo wo valongaga kuta vanu si vatsilipukaga, vakatsaje kwa Yesu na kumuputsa kuta, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mudahitsi, Musa avaga atulajitse kuta, munu manyi atajiche na kumuleka mufwile bila mwana, mung'olotse an'ganika amutole yula mufwile ili amulelele yula mung'olotse vana. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Kwavaga na vanyalukolo saba. Mulongola vawo akatolaje mudala na akatajikaje bila kulela mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Akavaje kutajika yula mulongola, mung'olotse va kavili akamutolaje yula mufwile, uyo nayo akatajikaje bila kulela mwana. Kaha na vakadatu yikavaje hihyo kota vayage. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Veka saba vakatajikaje bila kulela mwana kwa yula mudala. Hambele mudala yula nayo akatajikaje. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Tun'gana utulonjele kuta chipindi icho vanu hova kutsilipuka mudala uyo akuva va nani? Kwasawuli veka saba vavaga vamutolite.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu akavalonjelaje kuta, “Henye mun'yaga kwasawuli sinambe mugatsele mandiko ga Mulungu na wuvetso wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Iho vanu ho vakutsilipuka sivakutola awu kutoleka, kwasawuli vakuva kota vatantsi va kilanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Lechelelo itso ndongwa tsa wutsilipuko, mbe, simwasomile mu chitabu cha Musa, hila Mulungu fyo alontsile na Musa mu chila chisati cho chakaga moto, “Heni tsi Mulungu va Ibulahimu, na Mulungu va Yisaka, na Mulungu va Yakobo?” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Henye munkosela nachene, kwasawuli mun'ganika mutsele kuta, “Mulungu siyo va vanu yo vafweye, ila mwene yo Mulungu va vanu yo wumi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ngomi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lukasi 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mudahitsi yumwe va malajitso ga Musa avaga halubali anguvahulika Yesu na Masadukayo fyo vanlongana. Hoavaga kuwona hila Yesu fyo avajibwe finofu, nayo akamuputsaje Yesu, “Mu amuli tseka, yilikwiya yo ngomi kulutila tseka?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Amuli ngomi kulutila tseka yo iyi, Muhulikitse henye vanu va Isilaheli, Mutwa Mulungu venyu yo Mutwa yumwe hela. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Un'ganika umugane Mutwa Mulungu vako kwa numbula yako yeka, na kwa nyala tsako tseka, na kwa ludali lwako lweka. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Amuli ya kavili yo iyi, Un'ganika umugane muyago kota fyo ungigana heve. Kuduhu amuli ngomi kulutila itsi tsivili.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Yula mudahitsi va malajitso ga Musa akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Mudahitsi ulontsile finofu kuta Mulungu yo yumwe na kuduhu yunji lechelelo mwene ng'ani. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Kaha yin'ganika umugane Mulungu kwa numbula yako yeka, na kwa nyala tsako tseka, na kwa ludali lwako lweka, na umugane muyago kota fyo ungigana mwene. Lulongwa ulo lo lunofu kulutila kutawula nambiko na sadaka.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu aveye kuwona munu yula fyo ajibwe kwa ntselo, akamulonjelaje kuta, “Heve ulihabehi kwinjila mu Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilisito yo nani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lukasi 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu ho avaga anguvadahitsa vanu ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, akavaputsaje, “Kwasawuli yachi vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa valongaga kuta Chilisito yo Mwana va muntsajila Dawudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Kwasawuli mwene Dawudi kwa kulongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu alontsile kuta, Mutwa amulonje Mutwa vangu kuta, Wikale halubali lwangu lwa liwoko lililo, mbaka ho nguvasuma vatelani vako. <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Mwene muntsajila Dawudi amuchemile, Mutwa. Afuluche ndawuli kaha amucheme mwanage?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu anguvafunda vanu viyangalile na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Lukasi 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Vanu wolofu vakamuhulikitsaje Yesu kwa wuhechelelo. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu hoavaga an'dahitsa vanu, akavafundaje kuta, “Mwiyangalile na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, yo van'jenda kuno vafwite myenda mitali na kusamuswa kwa hesima na vanu hovankuva hono ha kugutsila finu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Kaha vaganaga kikalisa figoda fya kulutalo hovankuva mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi, na vapelwaga hesima mu mawungo. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Lechelelo vanu iwo vatolaga kwa wusugu finu mu nyumba tsa vafwile, na kusuka suko nali. Mutsele kuta vanu kota iwo vakuhigwa ndalahela.<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mufwile yo atawe sadaka nofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Lukasi 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu avaga ichite habehi na sandiko ya kutawulila sadaka yoyavaga hono ha Nyumba ya Mulungu. Akalavaje hila vanu wolofu fyo vantawula magobole mu sandiko ya kutawulila sadaka. Vafuchifu wolofu vakatawulaje magobole molofu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Lechelelo akatsaje mudala yumwe mufwile yoavaga mugayu akatawulaje sendi tsivili. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu akavachemaje vadahitswa vake na kuvalonjela, “Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli, mudala yuno mugayu na mufwile yo atawe fyeka fyoanafyo mu sandiko yino kulutila vanu veka. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Iva vanu veka vatawe magobole gogasije. Lechelelo mufwile yuno na yivaje mugayu, atawe fyeka fyo anafyo, atawe magobole geka go anago mbaka gala go gaka kumufwaya kulya.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga hila Nyumba ya Mulungu fyo yikubomolwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-25">Matayo 24:1-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lukasi 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu hoavaga anhuma ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, mudahitswa vake yumwe akamulonjelaje, “Mudahitsi, lave nyumba tsino fyo tsilifinofu! Lave na maganga gano gogatsentsile nyumba tsino fyogali manofu!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Mbe, umpomochela nyumba tsino ngomi? Chila liganga likubomolwa, kuduhu liganga lyo likusigala lyo likuva mwilanga mwa liyage, geka gano gakubomolwa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukodeka na kukodwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lukasi 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Hambele Yesu hoavaga ichite muchidunda cha Mitseyituni chochavaga mwambu na mwambu na Nyumba ya Mulungu. Petulo, na Yakobo, na Yohana, na Andeleya vakatsaje kwa wufiho na kumuputsa, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Utulonjele kuta ndongwa itso tsikuhumila hanili? Kaha chinu chachi cho chikuva ndajilo ya kutulajila kuta ndongwa itso tsilihabehi kuhumila?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu akantsaje kuvalonjela, “Mwiyangalilaje, alahogola munu yoyuve kuvadeteletsa. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Vanu wolofu vakutsa, kwa Litawa lyangu na kulonga wudesi kuta, Vene yo Chilisito!” Nawo vakuvadeteletsa vanu wolofu. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Nanye mukuhulika ndongwa tsa magalu, na fununu tsa magalu, henye mulekaje kutinuka. Kwasawuli tsin'ganika ndogwa itso tsilongole, lechelelo wula wudugo wung'ali. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Vanu va inyi yimwe vakwitova na vanu va inyi yinji na wuntsajila wukwitova na wuntsajila wunji, na hono hanjihanji kukuva na makakamo ga inyi, na kukuva na ntsala ngomi. Ndongwa itso tsinhwana kota hila wusungu fyo wulongolaga hala mwana ang'acha kuleleka. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Lechelelo ndongwa itso hotsikuva tsinhumila, henye mwiyangalile! Kwasawuli vanu vakuvasindika mu nyumba tsa wuhigo, na vakuvatova fiboko hono ha kitang'anila Vayawudi. Mukuhigwa kwa vatavala na vantsajila kwasawuli ya heni, ili muvalonjele ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ndongwa Nofu tsinganika tsilongole kuvikulwa kwa inyi tseka ho wukuva wung'acha kufika wudugo. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Iho hovakuva vavabite na kuvasindika ku nyumba tsa wuhigo, mwalahogola kukakama na kuhotsa kuta mukulonga chinu chachi. Kwasawuli Muhe va Mulungu akuvapelani luvala lulo chochin'ganika kulonga. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Chipindi icho munyalukolo akumupituka mung'olotse ili akopolwe, na mwana akupitukwa na dade ili akopolwe. Nawo vana vakuvapituka vadadawo na vayuvawo, vakuvatova na kuvakopola. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Vanu veka vakuvavipila kwasawuli munfwata heni. Lechelelo munu yo akikangatsa mbaka ku wudugo uyo yo akukuluka.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'odeko ngomi tso tsinkutsa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lukasi 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Iho ho mukuwona Chinu cha Kumuvipitsa Mulungu chili mu Nyumba yake.” Vanu yo vali ku Yudeya vabilimilaje kufidunda. Munu yo ansoma an'ganika atsele lulongwa ulo fyoluli. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Munu yoyuve yoali kivala kwa nyumba yake alahogola kwinjila mu nyumba na kutegula chinu chochive. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Munu yo ali kumugunda alahogola kuwuya kukaye kutegula myenda jake. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Vakudutsa vadala vala yo vabofu na vadala yo vankong'etsa mu chipindi icho. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mun'ganika mumusuche Mulungu ili chipindi icho chilekaje kuva chipindi cha chisisima. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Chipindi icho kukuva na ng'odeko ngomi yo siyilava yihumye kuhuma iho Mulungu fyo awumbite inyi mbaka sambi, na kaha siyikujela yihumile. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Manyi Mutwa aka aleche kutsipungutsa siku itso, kuduhuli munu yoyuve yo akakukuluka. Lechelelo kwasawuli ya vanu vake yo avahagwe, Mutwa akutsipungutsa siku itso. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Chipindi icho manyi munu avalonjele, Mulave, Chilisito yo yuno, awu kuta, Yo yula hala, mulekaje kumutumba munu uyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Vakuhumila valoli va wudesi wo vakichema kuta, Heni yo Chilisito! Nawo vakudita ndajilo na mitinuso, ili manyi vavetse vavayatse vanu vala yo avahagwe Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ihyo henye mun'ganika mwiyangalile, kwasawuli mwanga ntsivalonje ndongwa tseka chang'ani.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana va Munu ankutsa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lukasi 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Chipindi icho cha ng'odeko ngomi ho chikuva chilutye, litsuva likuva na jitsa na mwetsi si gukuvala. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Nyenyetsi tsikugwa kuhuma kilanga, na finu fya kilanga kwa Mulungu fikutigasika. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Iho vanu ho vakumbona heni Mwana va Munu ntsinkutsa mu mafuluka kwa wuvetso na wumelemo. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Heni nguvatuma vatantsi vangu va kilanga vavakong'ase kuhuma chila lubali lwa inyi vanu yo avahagwe, kuhuma mwantso gwa inyi mbaka wudugo wa inyi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madahitso ga mubichi gwa mutini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lukasi 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Mwidahitsaje kwa muhwano guno gwa mubichi gwa mutini. Manyi muguwone miputi jake jinlembula mahamba muntsela kuta chifuku chili habehi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Hohihyo manyi mutsiwone ndongwa tsila tso ntsivalonje hamutalo tsinhumila, mutselaje kuta heni Mwana va Munu ntili habehi kuwuya. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli, kuta chilelo chino sichi kulutila mbaka ndongwa itso tseka tsihumile. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Kilanga na inyi fikulutila, lechelelo ndongwa tsangu sitsikulutila.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu Munu yo antsela siku awu sala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Kuduhu munu yoyuve yo antsela siku awu sala kuta yikuva hanili, na vave vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, na ntsive heni Mwana va Mulungu, tweka sinambe tutsele, yo an'tsela ndongwa itso yo Dada ng'ani. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mun'ganika mwiyangalilaje na kuva miho, kwasawuli sinambe mutsele holukutsa luvala ulo. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Kuwuya kwa heni Mwana va Munu yikuva kota hila munu yo ayilesile kaye yake kwa vatantsi vake na mwene akabitaje kulujendo, kuno chila munu amupelye wuvetso wa kudita katsi, na kumulajitsa mwamilitsi va nyumba yila iyangalilaje na kuva miho. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Ihyo muvaje miho, kwasawuli sinambe mutsele hanili ho akuwuya munya nyumba, afuluche awuye hamihe, awu chilo na gati, awu ho tsinvika ntsogolo, awu habehi na kucha. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Muvaje miho, manyi atse kwa kutinukitsa alekaje kuvafika muvasise. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Lulongwa ulu lo ntsinguvalonjelani henye, lolulo lo ntsinguvalonjela vanu veka, muvaje miho!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Mipanjo ja kumukopola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lukasi 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Hotsavaga tsisije siku tsivili lifiche liwungo lya Pasaka na liwungo lya Mabumunda go galihela hamila. Vavina va vatawula nambiko na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa, vakantsaje kusaka hila fyovakudita kwa wusugu ili vamubate Yesu na kumukopola. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Lechelelo vakalonganaje, “Tuleche kumubata chipindi cha liwungo lya Pasaka, kwasawuli vanu vafuluche valete chitika.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mudala angumubaka Yesu mafuta go gampuchilila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Nayo Yesu avaga ku Betsaniya, kukaye kwa Simoni iho hamutalo yoavaga na wutamwa wa wububa. Hovavaga mumetsa vankulya chilyo, akatsaje mudala yumwe yoavaga na kasupa ka alabasita, kanya mafuta manofu go gampuchilila ga nalido ya magobole molofu, akakafungulaje kasupa kala na kumumiminila Yesu mafuta kumutwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Vanu vamwe yovavaga hono hala vakavipaje na kulongana, “Kwasawuli yachi an'yatsa mafuta gano ga galama ngomi? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Iga mafuta gakagafuluche gagutswe kwa magobole molofu ndalahela na magobole igo tukakuvapela vagayu!” Kahi vakamung'anulilaje mudala yula. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Lechelelo Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Kwasawuli yachi mungumutifya mudala yuno? Mumuleche! Chinu ichi choan'nditila heni yo chinofu. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Vagayu munawo siku tseka, na mufuluche muvatanje chipindi chochive cho mun'gana. Lechelelo simufuluche muve na heni siku tseka. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Mudala yuno adisile chila choavetsitse kudita, agumiminilye muvili gwangu mafuta go gan'mpuchilila kwasawuli ya kumbika chang'ani kwa matsiko gangu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ntsinguvalojelani wukweli, hono hohave mu inyi, vanu ho vakuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu, na lulongwa ulu loadisile mudala yuno lukutambulwa kwa wiwuko wake.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda Isikaliyoti angidichila kumupituka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lukasi 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yuda Isikaliyoti, muyawo va vala vadahitswa kumi na vavili va Yesu, akabitaje kwa vavina va vatawula nambiko na kugana amupituche Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Vavina va vatawula nambiko vaveye kuhulika ndongwa itso vakahechelelaje, vakalaganaje kuta Yuda manyi aludite lulongwa ulo vakumupela magobole. Kuhuma iho Yuda akantsaje kusaka hila fyo akudita lulongwa ulo lwa kumupituka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankulya chilyo cha Pasaka hamwe na vadahitswa vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Lukasi 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Hoyavaga kufika siku ya kwantsa ya liwungo lya mabumunda go galihela hamila, chipindi cho yisintswaga nambiko ya ntsanang'olo ya Pasaka, vadahitswa vake vakamuputsaje Yesu, “Un'gana tubite hono hachi tukuvichile chang'ani hono ho ukulila Pasaka?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yesu akavatumaje vadahitswa vake vavili na kuvalonjela kuta, “Mubite ku mujini, na uko mukitang'ana na munu yumwe mulume itwisile chitumbe cha malenga. Mumufwate munu uyo, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mbaka mu nyumba yo akwinjila, mukamulonjele munya nyumba iyo kuta mudahitsi ampuntsa kuta chilikwiya chumba cha vajentsi ho ngulila chilyo cha Pasaka hamwe na vadahitswa vangu? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Munu uyo akuvalajila chumba chikomi cha kugolofwa chochipambitwe chang'ani. Uko ko mutuvichile chang'ani filyo fya Pasaka!” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Vala vadahitswa vavili vakawukaje na kubita ku mujini, vakachifikaje chila chinu chili hihilaga kota fyo avalonje Yesu. Vakavikaje chang'ani filyo fya Pasaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Hoyavaga kufika hamihe, Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake kumi na vavili vakatsaje hono iho. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Hovavaga vankulya, Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli, muyenyu yumwe yo tunkulya hamwe hano, akumituka.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Vadahitswa vake vakasusutalaje, chila munu akamuputsaje Yesu, “Mbe, nguva heni yo ngukupituka?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Muyenyu yumwe ha henye kumi na vavili yo akutsangitsa hamwe libumunda mu bakuli, uyo yo akumituka. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Heni Mwana va Munu ntsim'bita kufwa kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuhuma katali. Lechelelo akudutsa munu yula yo akungaluka heni Mwana va Munu! Yika kuva chiba munu uyo akaave sialeliche!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilyo cha Mutwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lukasi 22:14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Hovavaga vankulya, Yesu akategulaje libumunda na kumulumba Mulungu, akalimegasaje na kuvapela vadahitswa vake na kulonga, “Mutegule mulye, ugu go muvili gwangu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Kahi akategulaje chikombe cha difwayi, akamulumbaje Mulungu na kuvapela, nawo veka vakang'welaje chikombe chicho. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Yino yo danda yangu yoyinlajila lilagano lya Mulungu, yoyim'boholwa kwasawuli ya vanu wolofu. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ntsinguvalonjelani wukweli, sifuluche ntsing'we kaha difwayi ya mutsabibu mbaka siku yila yo ngung'wa difwayi ntsipya ku Wuntsajila wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Yesu hamwe na vadahitswa vake vakimbaje lwimbo lwa kumutsumitsa Mulungu. Vakavaje kusinda kwimba vakawukaje vakabitaje ku Chidunda cha Mitseyituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anlonga kuta Petulo akumukana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lukasi 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Hovavaga mung'asi, Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Henye nyeka mukubilima na kundeka ntsiyena, kota fyo yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta Mulungu alontsile, Ngumutova mudimi natso ng'olo tsikutagalila. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Lechelelo honguva kutsilipuka nguvalongola kubita ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Ihyo Petulo akamulonjelaje Yesu, “Nayivaje veka iva vakuleche, heni singuhogola nguleche!” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu akamulonjelaje Petulo, “Ntsingukulonjela wukweli, chilo cha munyiguno ntsogolo ying'acha kuvika lwa kavili, heve ukung'ana mala kadatu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Lechelelo Petulo akakangatsaje kulonga, “Nayivaje ntsin'ganika ng'opolwe na heve, singuhogola ngukane. Vala vadahitswa vanji nawo vakalongaje hihyo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumusuka Mulungu ku Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lukasi 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Vavaga kufika hono hohanchemwa Getisemane. Yesu akavalonjelaje vadahitswa vake, “Mwikale bahanago, heni sogwe kumusuka Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Yesu akavategulaje Petulo, na Yakobo, na Yohana akabitaje nawo kutali chidogo. Akantsaje kususutala na kukodeka ndalahela munumbula. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Akavalonjelaje, “Wususutafu wo wuli mugati mwa numbula yangu wufuluche wung'opole. Mwikale hono hano na muvaje miho.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yesu akabitaje hatalo chidogo akipunaje hasi, akamusukaje Mulungu, “Mulungu, manyi ugane udite ndeche kukolela chipindi ichi cha ng'odeko.” <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Akalongaje, “Dada vangu, heve unvetsa kudita finu fyeka. Unyetsele chikombe chino cha ng'odeko, lechelelo siyo kota fyontsin'gana heni, yive kota fyoun'gana heve.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Yesu akawuyaje kwa vala vadahitswa vake vadatu akavafikaje vavasise. Akamuputsaje Simoni yo achemwaga Petulo, “Simoni uvasise tulo? Mbe, ulemilwe kikala miho nambe kwa lisala limwe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Yesu akawilaje kuvalonjela vadahitswa vake, “Mwikale miho na kumusuka Mulungu ili muleche kujetswa na ndongwa ntsibi. Henye mun'gana kikangatsa mu majetso, lechelelo mivili jenyu jilihela ludali.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yesu akabitaje kaha kumusuka Mulungu, akawilaje kusuka hihila kota hamutalo. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Hoavaga kuwuya lwa kavili akavafikaje vavasise kaha, kwasawuli vavaga na tulo sito ndalahela. Vakalemwaje kumulonjela chinu chochive. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Hoavaga kutsa lwa kadatu akavalonjelaje, “Mung'acha munvasa na kwesela? Duve mulamuche! Sala yifisile ya heni Mwana va munu ngubatika na kusindikwa kwa vanu yovan'dita ndongwa ntsibi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Ihyo mwinuche tubite. Mulave munu yula yo akumituka alihabehi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupitukwa na kibatika kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lukasi 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu hoavaga anlonga, akafikaje muyawo wa vala vadahitswa kumi na vavili yo achemwaga Yuda. Kuno ilongwitse na vanu wolofu wovana nyaladi na ndumbi. Vanu iwo vavaga vatumilwe na vavina va vatawula nambiko, na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na vavina veka. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda yo angumupituka Yesu, avaga avapelye ndajilo kuta, “Munu yula yo ngumusamusa kwa kumunonela mu ntsetse, uyo yo mumubate na kumusindika kwa Vimilitsi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuda avaga kufika hono hala, akabitaje hoavaga Yesu na kumuhejelela, akamuchemaje, “Mudahitsi!” Kaha akamusamusaje kwa kumunonela mu ntsetse. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Vanu vala wovatsitse hamwe na Yuda vakamubataje Yesu na kumuvika ha wimilitsi. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Lechelelo munu yumwe muyage na vala wovavaga vimite habehi na Yesu, akasomolaje waladi mu yala yake na kumudumula lipulichilo mutantsi va muvina va vatawula nambiko. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu akavalonjelaje vanu vala, “Mutsitse na ndumbi na nyaladi ili mumbate heni kota muwumiyani? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Siku tseka ntsadahitsaga ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, kwasawuli yachi simwambite hala ho ntsavaga na henye? Lechelelo ndongwa tsino tsinhumila ili Mandiko ga Mulungu gafichile.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ihyo vadahitswa vake veka vakamulekaje na kubilima. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kwavaga na mukwamitsi yumwe yoavaga afwite mugolole ng'ani akamufwataje Yesu. Vala vatelani vakajelaje kumubata, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />lechelelo mwene akisukulaje na kuvalechela mugolole, akabilimaje kuno alimwatsi.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu halutalo ha Lidama lya kuhijila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lukasi 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Vanu vala vakamusindikaje Yesu kwa muvina va vatawula nambiko, na vavina va vatawula nambiko, na vavina va Chiyawudi na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vavaga vali hono iho. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petulo nayo akamufwataje Yesu kwa kutali na akinjilaje mugati mwa lwigo lwa nyumba ya muvina va vatawula nambiko, akikalisaje na kota moto hamwe na vimilitsi. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Vala vavina va vatawula nambiko na vavina va Lidama lyeka lya Chiyawudi vakasakaje ndongwa tsa wudesi tso tsikudita vamukopole Yesu, lechelelo sivawupasile. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Vanu wolofu valontsile ndongwa tsa wudesi, lechelelo ndongwa tsawo tsa wudesi tsatelanaga. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Vanji vakimaje na kulonga ndongwa tsa wudesi, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Hetwe twamuhuliche Yesu anlonga kuta ngwananga Nyumba yino ya Mulungu yo yidisilwe na vanu, na siku ya kadatu ngutsenga yinji yo siyitsentsilwe na vanu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Lechelelo na yivaje valontsile ihyo, ndongwa tsawo tsatelanaga. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Muvina va vatawula nambiko akimaje hagati ha vanu veka na kumuputsa Yesu, “Mbe, kwasawuli yachi sinambe ulonje chinu chochive? Mbe, sinambe uhuliche chino cho vangukuhiga vanu vano?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Lechelelo Yesu akakatukaje mye! Sialontsile lulongwa loluve. Muvina va vatawula nambiko akamuputsaje kaha, “Mbe heve yo Chilisito Mwana va Mulungu yo antsumitswa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu akalongaje, “Ena, yo heni. Na henye mukumbona heni Mwana va Munu ntsichite lubali lwa liwoko lililo lya Muntsajila Munya Wuvetso, ntsinkutsa na mafuluka ga kilanga kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Iho Muvina va vatawula nambiko akademulaje kantsu yo afwite kulajila kuta avipye chila choalontsile Yesu, na kulonga, “Tun'gana wusayidi wachi kaha? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Vheka mumuhuliche fyo angumuliga Mulungu! Henye mun'gana tumudite ndawuli?” Vanu veka vakalongaje an'ganika kuhigwa akopolwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Kahi vamwe vakantsaje kumufunyila mati, vakamugubikaje chitambala kumiho na kwantsa kumutova na kumulonjela kuta, “Lagule nani yoakutofile!” Vamilitsi nawo vakamutovaje makofwi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo angumukana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lukasi 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petulo hoavaga ang'acha ku lwigo lwa nyumba ya muvina va vatawula nambiko, akatsaje muhintsa yumwe mutantsi va muvina va vatawula nambiko va Chiyawudi. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Muhintsa uyo hoavaga kumuwona Petulo ankota moto, akamukangatsilaje miho na kumulonjela, “Hihila heve nave muka hamwe na Yesu va ku Natsaleti.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Lechelelo Petulo akakanaje, “Sintsimutsele, na sinambe ntselewe cho unlonga.” Kahi Petulo akawukaje na kubita kivala kulwigo. Ntsogolo yikavikaje. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Yula muhintsa mupogotsi avaga kumuwona kaha Petulo, akantsaje kuvalonjela vanu wovavaga vimile hala kuta, “Munu yuno akahamwe na Yesu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Lechelelo Petulo akakanaje kaha. Simusika vanu wovavaga vimile iho vakamulonjelaje Petulo, “Nachene heve mukahamwe na Yesu, kwasawuli heve nave uli munu va ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Petulo akantsaje kilaha kuta, “Sintsimutsele munu uyo yomun'ndonjela ndongwa tsake, manyi ntsive ntsimudesi ng'otoche bahanago.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Iho ntsogolo yikavikaje lwa kavili. Petulo akiwukaje hila Yesu fyo aliamulonje kuta, “Ying'acha kuvika ntsogolo lwa kavili, ukung'ana heni mala kadatu.” Lulongwa ulo lukahomaje mu numbula ya Petulo na akantsaje kuvemba.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ansindikwa halutalo ha Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lukasi 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Hoyavaga kuva hamilawu, vavina va vatawula nambiko va Chiyawudi, hamwe na vavina veka va Chiyawudi, na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa. Vakalaganaje na kumuwopa Yesu, vakamusindikaje kwa Pilato muvina va Chilumi. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato akamuwutsaje Yesu, “Mbe, heve yo Muntsajila va Vayawudi?” Yesu akamulonjelaje, “Kota heve fyo unlonga.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Nawo vavina va vatawula nambiko vakamuhigaje Yesu kwa ndongwa ntsolofu. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato akamuputsaje kaha Yesu, “Mbe, heve ulihela lulongwa loluve lwa kujibula? Lave fyo vangukuhiga kwa ndongwa ntsolofu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Lechelelo Yesu sialontsile chinu chochive, ihyo Pilato akapomokaje.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anhigwa kukopolwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lukasi 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Chila ha liwungo lya Pasaka, Pilato avaga atsovye kumuwopola muwopwa yumwe yo vakumugana vanu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Chipindi icho kwavaga na munu yumwe muwopwa yo achemwaga Balaba, munu uyo avaga awopitwe mu nyumba ya vawopwa hamwe na vayage kwa nongwa tsinji hamwe na tsa kukopola vanu mu chitika. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Vala vanu wolofu vakakong'asikaje kwa Pilato kugana avaditile kota fyo avaditilaga chila mwaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato akavaputsaje kuta, “Mbe, mun'gana ntsimulechele yuno Muntsajila va Vayawudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilato alontsile ihyo kwasawuli atselaga kuta vavina va vatawula nambiko vamuletite Yesu kwa mbafya hela. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Lechelelo vala vavina va vatawula nambiko vavaga vavakosile vanu vala kuta vagane alechelwe Balaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Kaha Pilato akavaputsaje vala vanu, “Mun'gana tsimudite ndawuli munu yuno yomungumuchema Muntsajila va Vayawudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Vanu veka vakatovaje chiyove kuta, “Muvambe mu musalaba!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato akavaputsaje, “Kwasawuli ya chichi! Mbe, adisile lulongwa lwachi lubi?” Lechelelo vene vakatovaje chiyove, “Muvambe mu musalaba!” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato aganaga kuvagan'ya vala vanu, duve akamulechelaje Balaba ahume kuhuma nyumba ya vawopwa. Akavalajitsaje vanu vamutove Yesu mikotya, kahi akamutawulaje Yesu ili vamuvambe mu musalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamilitsi vangumubedala Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Kahi vimilitsi vakamusindikaje Yesu mbaka mugati mwa nyumba ya chintsajila ya Pilato, nyumba iyo yachemwaga Pulayitoliyo. Mumo vakakong'asaje vimilitsi wolofu. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Kaha vakamufwikaje kantsu ya chintsajila, vakabotaje na ng'ata ya mifwa ya chintsajila vakamufwikaje Yesu kumutwi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lanji ya tsambalawu yavaga yo lanji ya chintsajila</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Vala vimilitsi vakantsaje kumusamusa, “Kamwene be, muntsajila va Vayawudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Vakamutovajetovaje na lugoda kumutwi na kumufunyila mati, vakamufugamilaje na kwipuna halutalo hake. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Hovavaga kusinda mbedatsi tsawo, vakamuwopolaje Yesu kantsu ya chintsajila, vakamufwikaje myenda jake. Kahi vakamuhumyaje kivala ili vakamuvambe mu musalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anvambwa mu musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32">Matayo 27:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lukasi 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Hovavaga mung'asi vakitang'anaje na munu kuhuma Kulene yo achemwaga Simoni, dadawo va Alechitsanda na Lufo, munu uyo avaga anhuma ku mugunda. Nawo vimilitsi vakamulatsimitsaje itwiche musalaba gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Vala vimilitsi vakamusindikaje Yesu mbaka hono ho anchemwa Goligota, chinya kutijila, “Hono ha Chihanga cha munu yo atajiche.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Nawo vakamupelaje Yesu difwayi yo yihantsitswe na mugoda go gwachemwaga manemane, lechelelo mwene akalemaje kung'wa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ihyo vala vimilitsi vakamuvambaje Yesu mu musalaba, na vakagavanaje myenda jake kwa kujitovela simbi ili yilamulwe kuta nani ategule mwenda gwachi. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Yavaga kota saa tatu hino hamilawu, iho hovavaga vamuvambite Yesu mu musalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Hala ha musalaba vavaga vandiche chila cho vamuhijye kuta, “MUNTSAJILA VA VAYAWUDI.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Iho ho vamuvambite Yesu havaga na vawumiyani vavili vavambitwe mu misalaba, yumwe avaga lubali lwake lwa liwoko lililo na yunji lubali lwa liwoko lichiji. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ihyo yikavaje kota fyo yandikwe mu mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, “Vakamuvisile hamwe na vawumiyani!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibilia tsinji tsa katali tsilihela musitali guno</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Vanu wovavaga vanlutila mung'asi vakamuligaje Yesu, na kutsuntsa mitwi kwa mbedatsi kuno vanlonga, “Bee, heve yo walontsile ukubomola Nyumba ya Mulungu na kuyitsenga kwa siku tsidatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />lelo wikuluse wu mwene, wiche mu musalaba!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Hohihyo nawo vavina va vatawula nambiko hamwe na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakamubedalaje Yesu kwa kulonga, “Avakuluse vanu vanji, lechelelo sinambe avetse kwikulusa mwene, <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />na kaha alongaga kuta, manyi mwene yo Chilisito, manyi mwene yo Muntsajila va Vaisilaheli! Lelo iche iho ha musalaba na hetwe tukumutumba.” Hihila na vanu vala vawumiyani wo vali vavambitwe mu misalaba hamwe na Yesu nawo vakamuligaje.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankufwa mu musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lukasi 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Hoyavaga kufika saa sita mumunyi, jitsa likagubikaje inyi yeka kwa masaa gadatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Hoyavaga kufika saa tisa mumihe, Yesu akakolaje kwa kulonga kuta, “Eloyi, Eloyi, lama sabachitani?” Chinya kutijila, “Mulungu vangu, Mulungu vangu, mbona undesile?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Vanu vamwe yovavaga vimile vakalongaje, “Mumuhulikitse! Angumuchema Eliya yula yoavaga muloli va Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Munu yumwe akabilimaje na kutola siponji akayitsabikaje mu difwayi yo yihahile, na kuyivika mu lugoda na kumupela Yesu ang'we, kuno anlongaga kuta, “Lelo tulave manyi Eliya muloli va Mulungu akutsa kumwisa mu musalaba!” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu akakolaje kwa wusungu na kutajika. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ihyo lipantsiya lya hono hahagulwa mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, likademukaje fipande fivili luhuma kuchanya mbaka hanyi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi yoavaga imile halutalo ha musalaba gwa Yesu avaga kuhulika lila litsi, na kuwona hila fyo antajika, akalongaje, “Wukweli munu uyu avaga Mwana va Mulungu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Kaha kwavaga na vadala wo valolaga kwa kutali chila chinu chochahumilaga, na vamwinga vavaga Maliya yo ahumye ku Majidalene, na Salome, na Maliya yuvawo Yakobo mudodo na Jose. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Vadala iva wo vala wo vamufwataga Yesu na kumutanga hoavaga ku Galilaya. Kahi kwavaga na vadala vanji wolofu wo vatsitse hamwe na Yesu kuhuma ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antsikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lukasi 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Yavaga kufika hamihe, na kwasawuli yavaga siku ya kwivika chang'ani kwasawuli ya Siku ya Weselo, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />akatsaje Yusufu munu va ku Alimataya. Munu uyo avaga jumbe va kuhesimilwa ndalahela, munu va Lidama lya Chiyawudi. Mwene nayo antsindilaga kutsa kwa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu. Akabitaje kwa Pilato bila muloto na kusuka amupele muvili gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato akapomokaje hoavaga kuhulika kuta Yesu mwanga afweye. Akamuchemaje muvina yo avimililaga vimilitsi mya na kumuputsa kuta wukweli Yesu mwanga afweye. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilato avaga kulonjelwa na yula muvina yo avimililaga vimilitsi mya kuta Yesu afweye, akamulonjelaje Yusufu kuta akatole muvili gula. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Ihyo Yusufu akagulaje sanda, akisaje muvili gwa Yesu mu musalaba na kugupilinga mu sanda yila. Akabitaje kuguvika mugati mwa kabuli yoyali yihongulwe mu litalawe. Kahi akabidusaje liganga likomi ha winjililo wa kabuli. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Nawo Maliya va ku Majidalene na Maliya yuve va Jose vahawene hono hala ho vavisile muvili gwa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yesu an'tsilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lukasi 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Hoyavaga kulutila Siku ya Weselo, Maliya va ku Majidala yo Majidalene, na Salome, na Maliyamu yuve va Yakobo vakagulaje mafuta ga kupuchilila vakabitaje kugubaka muvili gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ihyo hoyavaga kung'acha hamilawu siku ya jumapili, vakabitaje ku kabuli ya Yesu litsuva holyantsaga kuhuma. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Hovavaga mung'asi vakiputsaje, “Munu vachi yo akutubidusila liganga lila ha winjililo wa kabuli?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Lechelelo hovavaga habehi na kufika vakalolaje, vakawonaje lila liganga mwanga libiduswe kuhuma hala ha winjililo wa kabuli. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ihyo hovavaga kwinjila mu kabuli, vakamuwonaje mukwamitsi yumwe yoafwite kantsu nali imile lubali lwa liwoko lililo. Nawo vala vadala vakapomokaje ndalahela. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Lechelelo yula mukwamitsi akavalonjelaje, “Muleche kupomoka. Mungumusaka Yesu va ku Natsaleti yo akavambitwe mu musalaba. Atsilipuche! Alihaduhu hono hano! Mulave hono ho vaka vamulambaliche. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Lelo mubite mukavalonjele Petulo hamwe na vadahitswa vake, kuta Yesu avalongwe kubita ku Galilaya, uko ko mukumuwona kota fyo aka avalajitse.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Ihyo vadala vala vakapomokaje na kuhuma luvilo mu kabuli kuno vankakama kwa muloto. Nawo sivamulonje munu yoyuve chinu chochive, kwasawuli vavaga na muloto ndalahela.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu angumuhumila Maliya va ku Majidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohana 20:11-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu hoavaga kutsilipuka kung'acha hamilawu siku ya jumapili, alongwe kwilajila kwa Maliya va ku Majidala yo Maliya Majidalene, yula yoavaga amuhetsitse misoka saba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibiliya tsinji tsa katali tsilihela misitali jino ja 9-20</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Maliya va ku Majidala akabitaje kuvalonjela chila chochivahumye vala wovavaga hamwe na Yesu, na chipindi anguvalonjela vavaga na chiguto kuno vanvemba. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Lechelelo hovavaga kuhulika kuta Yesu atsilipuche na mumi, na Maliya va ku Majidala amuwene, vakalemaje kumutumba kwa lulongwa ulo lo alontsile.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahumila vadahitswa vavili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Lukasi 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Hambele Yesu akavahumilaje vadahitswa vavili kwa sula yinji. Vadahitswa iwo vabitaga kumugunda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Nawo vala vadahitswa vavili hovavaga kumutsela Yesu vakawuyaje kuvalonjela vayawo, lechelelo vavaga kuhulika vakalemaje kuvatumba.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anguvahumila vadahitswa vake kumi na yumwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lukasi 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Hambele Yesu akavahumilaje vadahitswa vake kumi na yumwe wovavaga vankulya. Yesu akavang'anulilaje kwasawuli ya wutalamu wa numbula tsawo, na hila fyo valemile kuvatumba vala vayawo wovamuwene hoavaga kutsilipuka. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ihyo akavalonjelaje, “Mubite ku inyi tseka mukavikule Ndongwa Nofu kwa vanu veka. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Munu yoyuve yo akitumba Litawa lyangu na kubatitswa akukuluswa. Na yula yo akulema kuvatumba akuhigwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Natso ndajilo itsi tsikuva hamwe na iwo wova kitumba. Kwa wuvetso wa Litawa lyangu vakuhetsa misoka, na kulonga kwa ndonga ntsipya. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Manyi vibate ntsoka awu vang'we chinu chochive chinya sumu, sivakufwa. Vakuvavichila mawoko vatamwa kwa kuvasuchila nawo vakupona.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu antegulwa kubita kilanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lukasi 24:50-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Mutwa Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga na vadahitswa vake, akategulwaje kubita kilanga kwa Mulungu, akikalaje lubali lwa liwoko lililo lya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ihyo vala vadahitswa vakabitaje chila hono kuvavikula vanu Ndongwa Nofu. Nayo Mutwa Yesu akakolaje katsi hamwe nawo na kulajila Ndongwa tsake kwa ndajilo tso tsavaga nawo.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>